(4985065, 725976, 53147, '<td valign="top">That is one cool capture. I have always been fascinated by these creatures. I have to assume this is a zoo shot but dang it looks intense. The noise issues int he water are really mellowed out by the creature. Not digging the border. Very cool image overall.</td>', 'That is one cool capture. I have always been fascinated by these creatures. I have to assume this is a zoo shot but dang it looks intense. The noise issues int he water are really mellowed out by the creature. Not digging the border. Very cool image overall.', '2008-10-01 15:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
