(4985104, 725792, 25095, '<td valign="top">and now I have that song stuck in my head.."Don''t you know I''m still standing better than I ever did...Looking like a true survivor, feeling like a little kid...I''m still standing after all this time..."<br/> <br/>wonderful subject, you''d have a hard time getting me to leave a site like this.  Not under your control but I wish there were more clouds in the sky.  Not sure what it is but something about the area directly around the house is bothering me, seems like a fog or smoke but doesn''t look right...nice picture anyway.</td>', 'and now I have that song stuck in my head.."Don''t you know I''m still standing better than I ever did...Looking like a true survivor, feeling like a little kid...I''m still standing after all this time..." wonderful subject, you''d have a hard time getting me to leave a site like this.  Not under your control but I wish there were more clouds in the sky.  Not sure what it is but something about the area directly around the house is bothering me, seems like a fog or smoke but doesn''t look right...nice picture anyway.', '2008-10-01 15:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985108, 721318, 25095, '<td valign="top">not fair when you have beautiful subjects! ;)</td>', 'not fair when you have beautiful subjects! ;)', '2008-10-01 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985122, 726024, 25095, '<td valign="top">absolutly beautiful!  Love the colors, the placement, the sky..wow.  The grass seems a little bright for these types of clouds but seeing as the light is coming from the left, it could be correct.  Reminds me of home :(<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'absolutly beautiful!  Love the colors, the placement, the sky..wow.  The grass seems a little bright for these types of clouds but seeing as the light is coming from the left, it could be correct.  Reminds me of home :( Great job.', '2008-10-01 15:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
