(4985929, 723155, 97166, '<td valign="top">Jill and Duncan were just settling in for a little afternoon slap and tickle in the soft and inviting grasses of his Uncle''s Italian Riviera estate when it struck.  "My god, it''s beautiful", muttered Jill, moments before her flesh was seared from her bones.</td>', 'Jill and Duncan were just settling in for a little afternoon slap and tickle in the soft and inviting grasses of his Uncle''s Italian Riviera estate when it struck.  "My god, it''s beautiful", muttered Jill, moments before her flesh was seared from her bones.', '2008-10-01 22:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
