(4985934, 723217, 97166, '<td valign="top">I-RB2-K00L4U rose out of the tepid waters, and surveyed the land, finding no major life readings of any kind.  For a moment he was confused, but then it struck him.  Perhaps his masters didn''t actually mean he was too important to take part in the main invasion when they sent him to this backwards swamp land.  Perhaps, just perhaps, he wasn''t here on a very important top secret mission to assassinate the Prince of Algae Eaters after all.</td>', 'I-RB2-K00L4U rose out of the tepid waters, and surveyed the land, finding no major life readings of any kind.  For a moment he was confused, but then it struck him.  Perhaps his masters didn''t actually mean he was too important to take part in the main invasion when they sent him to this backwards swamp land.  Perhaps, just perhaps, he wasn''t here on a very important top secret mission to assassinate the Prince of Algae Eaters after all.', '2008-10-01 22:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
