(4985942, 724889, 35804, '<td valign="top">Well...I find this completely appealing. It''s familiar, I have been there...not literally, but this image brings about many recollections of this particular time of day. The simplicity of a day winding down, making way for night. Elegant and quiet...what''s not to like?</td>', 'Well...I find this completely appealing. It''s familiar, I have been there...not literally, but this image brings about many recollections of this particular time of day. The simplicity of a day winding down, making way for night. Elegant and quiet...what''s not to like?', '2008-10-01 22:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
