(4985944, 726722, 97166, '<td valign="top">Statue 1: "One day my son, all that you see will be yours"<br/> <br/>Statue 2: "Oh, thanks dad, considering we''re rock, you''ve survived half a millenia, and being ruler of something I can never move around in fills me with <b>such</b> an insane glee."<br/> <br/>Statue 1: "Don''t be a smart-ass boy, I won''t last forever, I am only granite"<br/> <br/>Statue 2: "I knew you''d lost your Marble."</td>', 'Statue 1: "One day my son, all that you see will be yours" Statue 2: "Oh, thanks dad, considering we''re rock, you''ve survived half a millenia, and being ruler of something I can never move around in fills me with such an insane glee." Statue 1: "Don''t be a smart-ass boy, I won''t last forever, I am only granite" Statue 2: "I knew you''d lost your Marble."', '2008-10-01 22:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
