(4985970, 721773, 83313, '<td valign="top">I want to like this because I see a lot of effort and I know this was a difficult shot to get. Not a lot of sharp focus areas however, it does not lead my eye to either the bee or the flower. I really want to give this one a high vote, (it''s better than I could do), but I can''t.</td>', 'I want to like this because I see a lot of effort and I know this was a difficult shot to get. Not a lot of sharp focus areas however, it does not lead my eye to either the bee or the flower. I really want to give this one a high vote, (it''s better than I could do), but I can''t.', '2008-10-01 23:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985972, 726578, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was not until moments later that Edgar made the heart-wrenching and terrible decision to put Ol'' Butterscotch down.  "He had the Twitches, what else could I do?" lamented Edgar, as he sought to comfort poor Susie.  It was not until years later that Susie discovered Ol'' Butterscotch had nothing of the sort, but Edgar DID have a problem adjusting the diopter on his camera.</td>', 'It was not until moments later that Edgar made the heart-wrenching and terrible decision to put Ol'' Butterscotch down.  "He had the Twitches, what else could I do?" lamented Edgar, as he sought to comfort poor Susie.  It was not until years later that Susie discovered Ol'' Butterscotch had nothing of the sort, but Edgar DID have a problem adjusting the diopter on his camera.', '2008-10-01 23:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
