(4985975, 719814, 97166, '<td valign="top">As Bernard glanced to his left, the vixen leaned ever closer to his ear, a seductive breath and a whispered invitation.  Bernard raised his eyebrow, and smiled. <br/> <br/>He knew those pearls would be worth at least a half-grand on the open market.</td>', 'As Bernard glanced to his left, the vixen leaned ever closer to his ear, a seductive breath and a whispered invitation.  Bernard raised his eyebrow, and smiled.  He knew those pearls would be worth at least a half-grand on the open market.', '2008-10-01 23:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985992, 725511, 97166, '<td valign="top">Ferdinand glanced up at the window, knowing that his target lay within.  It was supposed to be a simple job, easy money, but now he knew he''d been set up.  The eye was watching.  So much for simplicity, thought Ferdinand, yet he smiled.  Unbeknownst to his employer, his fee had just been raised considerably.  Ferdinand stared into the red eye of doom and began to plot, this had just become interesting...</td>', 'Ferdinand glanced up at the window, knowing that his target lay within.  It was supposed to be a simple job, easy money, but now he knew he''d been set up.  The eye was watching.  So much for simplicity, thought Ferdinand, yet he smiled.  Unbeknownst to his employer, his fee had just been raised considerably.  Ferdinand stared into the red eye of doom and began to plot, this had just become interesting...', '2008-10-01 23:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
