(4986080, 727193, 97166, '<td valign="top">In a sad turn of events, after saving the life of Frodo by making horses in the waves of the River Bruinen next to Rivendell to take down the Ring Wraiths, Gandalf spent his retirement into the 8th Age of Middle Earth by making a modest living creating animal shapes to scare poor unwary surfers with.  He finally passed a lonely, bitter old man.</td>', 'In a sad turn of events, after saving the life of Frodo by making horses in the waves of the River Bruinen next to Rivendell to take down the Ring Wraiths, Gandalf spent his retirement into the 8th Age of Middle Earth by making a modest living creating animal shapes to scare poor unwary surfers with.  He finally passed a lonely, bitter old man.', '2008-10-01 23:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4986091, 721628, 97166, '<td valign="top">Even after the cataclysm, Steven -- The Last Combine -- wouldn''t quit.  He would never quit.  He could never quit.  So, to this day, he wanders the lonely expanses of a never changing land, reaping the grain that only he can reap, to feed the people that only he can feed.<br/> <br/>It is life''s greatest tragedy that Steven could never realize that there were no people left, and those that he fed were only his imagination.</td>', 'Even after the cataclysm, Steven -- The Last Combine -- wouldn''t quit.  He would never quit.  He could never quit.  So, to this day, he wanders the lonely expanses of a never changing land, reaping the grain that only he can reap, to feed the people that only he can feed. It is life''s greatest tragedy that Steven could never realize that there were no people left, and those that he fed were only his imagination.', '2008-10-01 23:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
