(4986270, 725159, 80096, '<td valign="top">He''s also very gnarly-- needs a good brushing.</td>', 'He''s also very gnarly-- needs a good brushing.', '2008-10-02 00:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4986273, 726447, 97166, '<td valign="top">They silently paddled toward the boggy island, knowing their search could finally be over.  It had been weeks since they began, and they''d traced the source of their search here.  This small, uninhabitable tract of land in the middle of a distant lake.  They slowly approached, every sense on alert, as they landed the canoe. Did they have it cornered, or had it cornered them?  <br/> <br/>A sudden rush of noise to the left, a shot fired in panic, the coming apart of rational thought.<br/> <br/>Years later, the skeletal remains of the canoe was happened upon by a working crew. The bones were found shortly after.  A family of squirrels the only life to be seen.</td>', 'They silently paddled toward the boggy island, knowing their search could finally be over.  It had been weeks since they began, and they''d traced the source of their search here.  This small, uninhabitable tract of land in the middle of a distant lake.  They slowly approached, every sense on alert, as they landed the canoe. Did they have it cornered, or had it cornered them?   A sudden rush of noise to the left, a shot fired in panic, the coming apart of rational thought. Years later, the skeletal remains of the canoe was happened upon by a working crew. The bones were found shortly after.  A family of squirrels the only life to be seen.', '2008-10-02 00:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4986277, 727195, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was a less famous moment, the invention of the lighthouse that cast light everywhere... except for out to sea.</td>', 'It was a less famous moment, the invention of the lighthouse that cast light everywhere... except for out to sea.', '2008-10-02 00:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
