(4987315, 722458, 73235, '<td valign="top">These birds are very tough to photograph. To balance between the dark background and the white feathers is most difficult. Unfortunately you picked (had to pick) a time when the sun was up very high, creating this high contrast situation. Unless you correct your camera by underexposing, the camera will think it''s a dark picture and expose to the background, blowing out the whites in the bird.</td>', 'These birds are very tough to photograph. To balance between the dark background and the white feathers is most difficult. Unfortunately you picked (had to pick) a time when the sun was up very high, creating this high contrast situation. Unless you correct your camera by underexposing, the camera will think it''s a dark picture and expose to the background, blowing out the whites in the bird.', '2008-10-02 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
