(4987616, 725342, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, and yes, fairytale like.  The only thing I am unsure about, and for me it is very distracting, is the catchlights in the deers'' eyes. I cannot see how they are there, given the way the light is falling, and they are so large and bright that they give the appearance of being holes!</td>', 'Very pretty, and yes, fairytale like.  The only thing I am unsure about, and for me it is very distracting, is the catchlights in the deers'' eyes. I cannot see how they are there, given the way the light is falling, and they are so large and bright that they give the appearance of being holes!', '2008-10-02 17:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987619, 727152, 16739, '<td valign="top">wow . I love this , I stood in the same place  I wish mine came out this good  9</td>', 'wow . I love this , I stood in the same place  I wish mine came out this good  9', '2008-10-02 17:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987625, 727086, 94265, '<td valign="top">Wildiris? Very crisp and sharp in places, nice and soft in others, great DOF. Quite comical too.</td>', 'Wildiris? Very crisp and sharp in places, nice and soft in others, great DOF. Quite comical too.', '2008-10-02 17:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987629, 726555, 16739, '<td valign="top">I love that song , great job  7</td>', 'I love that song , great job  7', '2008-10-02 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987633, 726966, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast on the house and the water, it''s just little bit dark in the sky. It''s a great scene and a very well-done shot.</td>', 'I love the contrast on the house and the water, it''s just little bit dark in the sky. It''s a great scene and a very well-done shot.', '2008-10-02 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987636, 725044, 67258, '<td valign="top">Smoke I take it, judging from the title, although this could also be a stormy cloudscape.  Initially I dismissed the photo as having little to interest me and to keep my attention, but actually I think there is more to it.  One to come back to later, I think.</td>', 'Smoke I take it, judging from the title, although this could also be a stormy cloudscape.  Initially I dismissed the photo as having little to interest me and to keep my attention, but actually I think there is more to it.  One to come back to later, I think.', '2008-10-02 17:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987637, 723617, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, his eyes look fabulous. Great focus.</td>', 'Nice contrast, his eyes look fabulous. Great focus.', '2008-10-02 17:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987642, 725602, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love landscape shots like these that are full of different colours and rock formations, great job, wondeful clarity.</td>', 'I love landscape shots like these that are full of different colours and rock formations, great job, wondeful clarity.', '2008-10-02 17:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987643, 725549, 67258, '<td valign="top">The model has lovely bone structure, but sadly the profile of her face is not easily visible because of the placement of her arm.  Nonetheless, a very pleasing photo.</td>', 'The model has lovely bone structure, but sadly the profile of her face is not easily visible because of the placement of her arm.  Nonetheless, a very pleasing photo.', '2008-10-02 17:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987647, 725208, 16739, '<td valign="top">I have seen a lot of Niagara  shots , But this is the coolest one   7</td>', 'I have seen a lot of Niagara  shots , But this is the coolest one   7', '2008-10-02 17:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987650, 725343, 94265, '<td valign="top">Her hair is beautiful and she''s a lovely fuller-figured bride. Nice crop and lighting.</td>', 'Her hair is beautiful and she''s a lovely fuller-figured bride. Nice crop and lighting.', '2008-10-02 17:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987655, 726784, 67258, '<td valign="top">Blimey, you were well positioned!</td>', 'Blimey, you were well positioned!', '2008-10-02 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987673, 724442, 63398, '<td valign="top">Banff?</td>', 'Banff?', '2008-10-02 17:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987682, 725589, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2008-10-02 17:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987703, 720910, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrancy of the blue, great shot.</td>', 'I love the vibrancy of the blue, great shot.', '2008-10-02 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987709, 727157, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and a very pretty model. This is a genuinely pleasant scene.</td>', 'Lovely colours and a very pretty model. This is a genuinely pleasant scene.', '2008-10-02 17:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987714, 723441, 94265, '<td valign="top">The title really gets me thinking, so many stories could be here. I love the tone and the model''s expression, great job.</td>', 'The title really gets me thinking, so many stories could be here. I love the tone and the model''s expression, great job.', '2008-10-02 17:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987718, 723373, 94265, '<td valign="top">Those lights make her skin a bit yellow but I love the mood of this shot, the outfit she''s (almost) wearing is awesome.</td>', 'Those lights make her skin a bit yellow but I love the mood of this shot, the outfit she''s (almost) wearing is awesome.', '2008-10-02 17:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987722, 726571, 73235, '<td valign="top">I am sure this picture means a lot to you. What are other viewers seeing? A boy goin next to a man. THey seem unrelated, they are not facing eachother, they are not interacting at all. Both bodies seem very soft.</td>', 'I am sure this picture means a lot to you. What are other viewers seeing? A boy goin next to a man. THey seem unrelated, they are not facing eachother, they are not interacting at all. Both bodies seem very soft.', '2008-10-02 17:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987723, 723223, 94265, '<td valign="top">If those are army boots, then it''s funny. If not, then I think bare feet would''ve been better. Either way, good idea and nice DOF, crop''s maybe a teeny bit tight on top.</td>', 'If those are army boots, then it''s funny. If not, then I think bare feet would''ve been better. Either way, good idea and nice DOF, crop''s maybe a teeny bit tight on top.', '2008-10-02 17:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987728, 726842, 94265, '<td valign="top">Brilliant sharpness and his eyes are very pretty, the simple tones of his clothes and the background are flattering to his skin tone.</td>', 'Brilliant sharpness and his eyes are very pretty, the simple tones of his clothes and the background are flattering to his skin tone.', '2008-10-02 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 1);
