(4987764, 725751, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s one of you people that went to the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=814384&amp;highlight=salt%20flats&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SLC (Utah) Area GTG - Let''s beat the heat!</a>. It''s not my type of photo but it''s certainly a 10. You could have at least cleaned the tires off - they do in all the TV ads.</td>', 'Well, it''s one of you people that went to the SLC (Utah) Area GTG - Let''s beat the heat!. It''s not my type of photo but it''s certainly a 10. You could have at least cleaned the tires off - they do in all the TV ads.', '2008-10-02 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
