(4987784, 726940, 62187, '<td valign="top">Ireland huh? I know a couple of people in Ireland. One of them doesn''t want to hear from me anymore. Sorry if it''s you. };&gt;)<br/> <br/>Anyway, the photo is lovely and because of the varying depths of the objects, I''m seeing a really cool three dimensional effect. The focus is not super sharp to me but has a kind of soft look which to me, adds a touch of mystery to such a place. It looks like the photo is pretty much out-of-the-camera which is certainly good enough for me. I think the sky could have used a touch of dodge and burn. My favorite part is the land above the green boat. Nice. I''m going with a 9 as a total for the photo.</td>', 'Ireland huh? I know a couple of people in Ireland. One of them doesn''t want to hear from me anymore. Sorry if it''s you. };>) Anyway, the photo is lovely and because of the varying depths of the objects, I''m seeing a really cool three dimensional effect. The focus is not super sharp to me but has a kind of soft look which to me, adds a touch of mystery to such a place. It looks like the photo is pretty much out-of-the-camera which is certainly good enough for me. I think the sky could have used a touch of dodge and burn. My favorite part is the land above the green boat. Nice. I''m going with a 9 as a total for the photo.', '2008-10-02 18:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987786, 727172, 90173, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2008-10-02 18:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
