(4987804, 723953, 62187, '<td valign="top">Jo, when are you going to at least learn the names of the stars you are looking at? And I don''t care how much you want to believe it, that''s not a meteor! Now, it''s really nighttime and far too past your bedtime. You should have been asleep a long time ago! (A better job this time around at a real-time night sky and not so jelly-like.)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=726090" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62187/120/726090.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62187/120/726090.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62187/120/726090.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Jo, when are you going to at least learn the names of the stars you are looking at? And I don''t care how much you want to believe it, that''s not a meteor! Now, it''s really nighttime and far too past your bedtime. You should have been asleep a long time ago! (A better job this time around at a real-time night sky and not so jelly-like.) ', '2008-10-02 18:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
