(4987873, 725342, 62187, '<td valign="top">I sometimes like to guess. I reminds me of one of my favorite photographers here at DPC: [user]Heneck[/user]. The depth of focus is super excellent and the amount of sharpness superb - especially to the point that it brought out a tiny amount of gleam in their eyes. Wow, really excellent. 10 of course. If this is not Hannah, I apologize but look at her work and you might see why I thought it was her.</td>', 'I sometimes like to guess. I reminds me of one of my favorite photographers here at DPC: [user]Heneck[/user]. The depth of focus is super excellent and the amount of sharpness superb - especially to the point that it brought out a tiny amount of gleam in their eyes. Wow, really excellent. 10 of course. If this is not Hannah, I apologize but look at her work and you might see why I thought it was her.', '2008-10-02 18:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
