(4988153, 724156, 97166, '<td valign="top">George the Maple was never able to get over the fact that he was the first one of his peer group to start to change.  His parents always told him that it would happen one day, but to be the only one in his lawn to grow Red there was an embarrassment in the locker room.  It didn''t help that he knew everyone would go through it eventually.  <br/> <br/>Years later, his revenge was sweet, as the leaves began to fall, and he was one of the last to lose them.</td>', 'George the Maple was never able to get over the fact that he was the first one of his peer group to start to change.  His parents always told him that it would happen one day, but to be the only one in his lawn to grow Red there was an embarrassment in the locker room.  It didn''t help that he knew everyone would go through it eventually.   Years later, his revenge was sweet, as the leaves began to fall, and he was one of the last to lose them.', '2008-10-02 21:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
