(4988213, 727062, 97166, '<td valign="top">Screech screamed as the dreaded Grass Newt leapt from the ground and latched onto his tongue. As it began to devour the sensitive organ, Screech''s cries and shrieks were heard by everyone around, but there was naught that they could do.  The Grass Newt''s terror was legendary, its appetite voracious.  <br/> <br/>Screech was doomed.</td>', 'Screech screamed as the dreaded Grass Newt leapt from the ground and latched onto his tongue. As it began to devour the sensitive organ, Screech''s cries and shrieks were heard by everyone around, but there was naught that they could do.  The Grass Newt''s terror was legendary, its appetite voracious.   Screech was doomed.', '2008-10-02 21:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
