(4988734, 719232, 84907, '<td valign="top">I hope this shot gets the scores and credit it deserves.  This one is brilliant in my opinion.  Framing is  excellent and background does not detract from the clear focus of the shot.  The grittiness of the wool is excellent but doesn''t appear to be over sharpened either.  Just a great shot.  The toning is also perfect.  Great job.</td>', 'I hope this shot gets the scores and credit it deserves.  This one is brilliant in my opinion.  Framing is  excellent and background does not detract from the clear focus of the shot.  The grittiness of the wool is excellent but doesn''t appear to be over sharpened either.  Just a great shot.  The toning is also perfect.  Great job.', '2008-10-03 00:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
