(4988771, 725839, 84907, '<td valign="top">This looks like an HDR to me.  And while there are many times where I like that look the yellows on the left side are distracting me on this one.  Specifically the bush/tree half way up on the left looks really grainy/artifacty to me.  Also some of the foreground browns appear the same way to me.  I really like the clouds and everything from the big trees on the right back, but the left and foreground really hurt that for me.</td>', 'This looks like an HDR to me.  And while there are many times where I like that look the yellows on the left side are distracting me on this one.  Specifically the bush/tree half way up on the left looks really grainy/artifacty to me.  Also some of the foreground browns appear the same way to me.  I really like the clouds and everything from the big trees on the right back, but the left and foreground really hurt that for me.', '2008-10-03 01:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
