(4989324, 727065, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice night scene, well composed and good sharpness.  Looks like it could use some masking and dodging/burning to equalize the exposure between the foreground and the skyline ... actually I would not have noticed that except for your title, which made me look closer and I saw the boats, which I otherwise would have missed because they are too dark to really stand out as the subject of your shot!</td>', 'Nice night scene, well composed and good sharpness.  Looks like it could use some masking and dodging/burning to equalize the exposure between the foreground and the skyline ... actually I would not have noticed that except for your title, which made me look closer and I saw the boats, which I otherwise would have missed because they are too dark to really stand out as the subject of your shot!', '2008-10-03 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
