(4989366, 725506, 70270, '<td valign="top">I''m really liking the processing on this one ... not overprocessed in a garish way like many that try this technique.  As it is, the image is a great background.  Place a subject in the middle of that clearing and it would be even better.</td>', 'I''m really liking the processing on this one ... not overprocessed in a garish way like many that try this technique.  As it is, the image is a great background.  Place a subject in the middle of that clearing and it would be even better.', '2008-10-03 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
