(4989431, 724932, 58272, '<td valign="top">I think this has great potential. The lighting seems a little harsh, or perhaps there needs to be a stronger fill light to the right to soften some of the strong shadows (I only have one strobe right now and it''s a problem I have time and again). I think you''ve captured the details in her face well, but really crisp eyes would set this off nicely for me. I''m also curious about the blur as it doesn''t look even as such, which makes me wonder if it was added in post processing... just my thoughts, I''m certainly not great at portraits so I hope this doesn''t sound harsh.</td>', 'I think this has great potential. The lighting seems a little harsh, or perhaps there needs to be a stronger fill light to the right to soften some of the strong shadows (I only have one strobe right now and it''s a problem I have time and again). I think you''ve captured the details in her face well, but really crisp eyes would set this off nicely for me. I''m also curious about the blur as it doesn''t look even as such, which makes me wonder if it was added in post processing... just my thoughts, I''m certainly not great at portraits so I hope this doesn''t sound harsh.', '2008-10-03 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
