(4989566, 725974, 73235, '<td valign="top">I believe an other crop could make this picture much more interesting. From my point, the focal point are the heads of the grassing horses. By adding so much space around them, you take this focus away. Did you think about a real tight crop around the heads only? On my monitor the freens are too saturated.</td>', 'I believe an other crop could make this picture much more interesting. From my point, the focal point are the heads of the grassing horses. By adding so much space around them, you take this focus away. Did you think about a real tight crop around the heads only? On my monitor the freens are too saturated.', '2008-10-03 12:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989567, 726701, 67152, '<td valign="top">the skin tones and smoothness is outstanding, the framing with the wreaths works great but i am quite troubled by the dark shadows that seem to cut across her face</td>', 'the skin tones and smoothness is outstanding, the framing with the wreaths works great but i am quite troubled by the dark shadows that seem to cut across her face', '2008-10-03 12:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
