(4990875, 727008, 84907, '<td valign="top">This is fanfreakingtastic.  This is an excellent shot made even better by excellent pp.  Great job with the eyes and bringing back the detail in just the right spots.  Only area that I notice is the right ear (pictures left) probably could have had some more detail brought back as it is tell tale blur added.  The hair right there could have been brought back a little more as well.  That being said that is nitpicky supreme.  Especially since you are getting a 10 from me.  Makes my top 3 easy.  If this isn''t first page I will be extremely disappointed.</td>', 'This is fanfreakingtastic.  This is an excellent shot made even better by excellent pp.  Great job with the eyes and bringing back the detail in just the right spots.  Only area that I notice is the right ear (pictures left) probably could have had some more detail brought back as it is tell tale blur added.  The hair right there could have been brought back a little more as well.  That being said that is nitpicky supreme.  Especially since you are getting a 10 from me.  Makes my top 3 easy.  If this isn''t first page I will be extremely disappointed.', '2008-10-04 01:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
