(4990886, 721798, 84907, '<td valign="top">I feel awful because I have this feeling that my vote and voice will be in the minority on this one.  I think it is brilliant.  The lighting gives this an amazing feeling of texture.  The framing is wonderful and I have nothing to give for improvement.  This is what I call fine art.  Very very well done!  On my first page.</td>', 'I feel awful because I have this feeling that my vote and voice will be in the minority on this one.  I think it is brilliant.  The lighting gives this an amazing feeling of texture.  The framing is wonderful and I have nothing to give for improvement.  This is what I call fine art.  Very very well done!  On my first page.', '2008-10-04 01:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
