(4992052, 719095, 97166, '<td valign="top">When they finally discovered that Woody Harrelson was moonlighting in a dangerous hobby, Universal Pictures was outraged.  He''d just insured his, quote, "Fantasically Fabulous Physique" for Thirty Million dollars. <br/> <br/>Suffice it to say, his premiums went up the next day.</td>', 'When they finally discovered that Woody Harrelson was moonlighting in a dangerous hobby, Universal Pictures was outraged.  He''d just insured his, quote, "Fantasically Fabulous Physique" for Thirty Million dollars.  Suffice it to say, his premiums went up the next day.', '2008-10-04 23:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
