(4992068, 726966, 91496, '<td valign="top">Bold lines and great bright white and dark black.  The processing might be a bit much.  The shoreline seems to tilt which is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Bold lines and great bright white and dark black.  The processing might be a bit much.  The shoreline seems to tilt which is a bit distracting.', '2008-10-04 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
