(4992077, 726524, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice compostition.  The rock in the foreground works well.  Really need to get the little fella out of the shade though for maximum impact.</td>', 'Nice compostition.  The rock in the foreground works well.  Really need to get the little fella out of the shade though for maximum impact.', '2008-10-04 23:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
