(4992081, 725533, 84124, '<td valign="top">I look at a shot like this and just wonder how anyone in their right mind can score it less than a 7, this is just an absolutely beautiful action shot that works on so many levels.  Easily one of the best I''ve seen on dpc, I think I''m becoming a sucker for B&amp;W...</td>', 'I look at a shot like this and just wonder how anyone in their right mind can score it less than a 7, this is just an absolutely beautiful action shot that works on so many levels.  Easily one of the best I''ve seen on dpc, I think I''m becoming a sucker for B&W...', '2008-10-04 23:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4992083, 726656, 84124, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had a great wide open vista, but a few things went wrong, that big pile of mud/dirt is distracting, the focus is off by a hair and there''s a bit too much saturation in the image.</td>', 'Looks like you had a great wide open vista, but a few things went wrong, that big pile of mud/dirt is distracting, the focus is off by a hair and there''s a bit too much saturation in the image.', '2008-10-04 23:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4992084, 717620, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great sky and silouttes.  The crop might be a little tight on the bottom and on the right.</td>', 'Great sky and silouttes.  The crop might be a little tight on the bottom and on the right.', '2008-10-04 23:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4992086, 727207, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Negative space on upper left works for me, but the right side could have been cropped and thus pulled the planes out of the center and given them more impact.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Negative space on upper left works for me, but the right side could have been cropped and thus pulled the planes out of the center and given them more impact.', '2008-10-05 00:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4992087, 726940, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great colors on the boats and the reflections.  The washed out hills and sky detract somewhat.  A greaduated ND filter (or similar effect from PP) can help with the difference in brightness on landscape photos.</td>', 'Great colors on the boats and the reflections.  The washed out hills and sky detract somewhat.  A greaduated ND filter (or similar effect from PP) can help with the difference in brightness on landscape photos.', '2008-10-05 00:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
