(4992209, 726498, 82985, '<td valign="top">unusual, unique--I like the slightly warm tonality.  Her softness contrasts with the harsher textures, and her mood seems to fit her location. The angle seems to make her head appear a bit large in relation to her body, but not distractingly so--only because I am spending a lot of time with this image.  Her eyes are spot on perfect--sharp and luminous, and you have done well in keeping her the brightest element overall.  I think maybe a pose change (slight) that has a shoe peeking out from under the dress might connect her to the ground a bit--she seems disconnected from it somehow.  I like the hands behind the back--works well with her slightly defensive expression.  Nicely done.  9</td>', 'unusual, unique--I like the slightly warm tonality.  Her softness contrasts with the harsher textures, and her mood seems to fit her location. The angle seems to make her head appear a bit large in relation to her body, but not distractingly so--only because I am spending a lot of time with this image.  Her eyes are spot on perfect--sharp and luminous, and you have done well in keeping her the brightest element overall.  I think maybe a pose change (slight) that has a shoe peeking out from under the dress might connect her to the ground a bit--she seems disconnected from it somehow.  I like the hands behind the back--works well with her slightly defensive expression.  Nicely done.  9', '2008-10-05 02:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4992212, 721798, 82985, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is my kind of image--cept that I am not good enough to nail one like it!   Tones, textures, lines, composition, lighting--excellent on all counts.  9</td>', 'Oh, this is my kind of image--cept that I am not good enough to nail one like it!   Tones, textures, lines, composition, lighting--excellent on all counts.  9', '2008-10-05 02:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
