(4992217, 725136, 82985, '<td valign="top">beautiful, tonality is wonderful, lighting has an open-shade coolness to it that feels very natural and unmanipulated--and the reflection in her eyes of the sky/trees/clouds (?) reinforces the natural coolness of the light and the day, and adds a nice shimmer/sparkle.  change nothing. 8</td>', 'beautiful, tonality is wonderful, lighting has an open-shade coolness to it that feels very natural and unmanipulated--and the reflection in her eyes of the sky/trees/clouds (?) reinforces the natural coolness of the light and the day, and adds a nice shimmer/sparkle.  change nothing. 8', '2008-10-05 02:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
