(4992233, 719642, 82985, '<td valign="top">oh, SO nice--unique POV, luminous exposure, and the eye contact with both people just makes this image--almost like you were caught in the act of sneaking the shot!  well done!  8</td>', 'oh, SO nice--unique POV, luminous exposure, and the eye contact with both people just makes this image--almost like you were caught in the act of sneaking the shot!  well done!  8', '2008-10-05 02:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
