(4992595, 721318, 30982, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of bspurgeon''s beautiful girls - Isabella, maybe?  Great portrait - high key works well, and she''s just too darn cute for words.</td>', 'This looks like one of bspurgeon''s beautiful girls - Isabella, maybe?  Great portrait - high key works well, and she''s just too darn cute for words.', '2008-10-05 06:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
