(4992601, 723111, 30982, '<td valign="top">Turkeys are really ugly birds - but rather fascinating just the same.  Nice job with the color and good use of the bokeh here.</td>', 'Turkeys are really ugly birds - but rather fascinating just the same.  Nice job with the color and good use of the bokeh here.', '2008-10-05 06:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
