(4992617, 724165, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant - I like how the petals on the lower flower are slightly blemished - adds a lovely realness to this.  Color, shallow DOF, background, lighting - all excellent.</td>', 'Simple and elegant - I like how the petals on the lower flower are slightly blemished - adds a lovely realness to this.  Color, shallow DOF, background, lighting - all excellent.', '2008-10-05 06:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4992621, 726887, 30982, '<td valign="top">The fact you can''t see her eyes - not even a hint, really adds to the "coldness" of this.  And yet her skintones and hair in the foreground give off a warmth - very interesting contradiction created.</td>', 'The fact you can''t see her eyes - not even a hint, really adds to the "coldness" of this.  And yet her skintones and hair in the foreground give off a warmth - very interesting contradiction created.', '2008-10-05 06:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
