(4992715, 727047, 68586, '<td valign="top">''Roman Pigeon'' lesser known cousin of the famous film director Roman Polanski, seen here choosing a location for his new film ''Two White Ankles''.<br/> <br/>In this shot he is interviewing ''ankle models'' hoping to cast the perfect person to be his backdrop.<br/> <br/> :- )<br/> <br/>Nice processing and dynamics with your two models leaving the picture in opposite directions, one very small, one comparatively very tall, both with white ankles and darker outfits, and the cobbles adding that final touch of texture.</td>', '''Roman Pigeon'' lesser known cousin of the famous film director Roman Polanski, seen here choosing a location for his new film ''Two White Ankles''. In this shot he is interviewing ''ankle models'' hoping to cast the perfect person to be his backdrop.  :- ) Nice processing and dynamics with your two models leaving the picture in opposite directions, one very small, one comparatively very tall, both with white ankles and darker outfits, and the cobbles adding that final touch of texture.', '2008-10-05 07:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
