(4993583, 727013, 97166, '<td valign="top">Little did they know the smile wasn''t because she was about to open a fresh, tasty can of Pepsi, no, the smile was because she was pretending to open it for her little brother, but had earlier put a spider in the can!</td>', 'Little did they know the smile wasn''t because she was about to open a fresh, tasty can of Pepsi, no, the smile was because she was pretending to open it for her little brother, but had earlier put a spider in the can!', '2008-10-05 18:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993588, 722059, 97166, '<td valign="top">Billy was finally free.  FREE!!  <br/> <br/>As he stood there for a moment, contemplating where he would go, he heard a sound behind him. He turned, and there, flapping in the wind, was an old cloth caught on the fence of his old pen.  <br/> <br/>With a sigh and pout, Billy walked back into his pen to munch on the piece of fabric.  Freedom could wait.</td>', 'Billy was finally free.  FREE!!   As he stood there for a moment, contemplating where he would go, he heard a sound behind him. He turned, and there, flapping in the wind, was an old cloth caught on the fence of his old pen.   With a sigh and pout, Billy walked back into his pen to munch on the piece of fabric.  Freedom could wait.', '2008-10-05 18:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993590, 726729, 97166, '<td valign="top">Gordon had had a rough life, and now he was at the edge of ending it all.  It would be simple. One step, and it would all be over.  Gordon looked down into the churning morass, steeled himself, and took the plunge. <br/> <br/>Moments later he cursed himself once again, as he soared over the stream.  Perhaps it wasn''t the best suicide method for a <b>bird</b>.</td>', 'Gordon had had a rough life, and now he was at the edge of ending it all.  It would be simple. One step, and it would all be over.  Gordon looked down into the churning morass, steeled himself, and took the plunge.  Moments later he cursed himself once again, as he soared over the stream.  Perhaps it wasn''t the best suicide method for a bird.', '2008-10-05 18:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993593, 723313, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was one of the more exciting times in these parts, the gathering of the Rock Club of Bear Lake</td>', 'It was one of the more exciting times in these parts, the gathering of the Rock Club of Bear Lake', '2008-10-05 18:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993596, 726744, 97166, '<td valign="top">"Tell me about the Aphids George."<br/> <br/>"Well Lenny, one day we''ll have a bush all of our own, and we''ll raise aphids on it Lenny."<br/> <br/>"Can I pet the Aphids George? Can I huh? Can I?"<br/> <br/>"Yes Lenny, you can pet all the Aphids you like."<br/> <br/>"Oh George, I''ll have my very own Aphid, and I''ll hug him, and squeeze him, and call him George."<br/> <br/>"One day Lenny, one day."</td>', '"Tell me about the Aphids George." "Well Lenny, one day we''ll have a bush all of our own, and we''ll raise aphids on it Lenny." "Can I pet the Aphids George? Can I huh? Can I?" "Yes Lenny, you can pet all the Aphids you like." "Oh George, I''ll have my very own Aphid, and I''ll hug him, and squeeze him, and call him George." "One day Lenny, one day."', '2008-10-05 18:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993598, 726889, 97166, '<td valign="top">In the aftermath, some still remained. They milled about in smaller numbers, sure, but one could never know if and when they''d strike again.  Poor Miller the Lifeguard, not a scrap of <b>him</b> was ever found after that day, the day the Sandpipers struck.</td>', 'In the aftermath, some still remained. They milled about in smaller numbers, sure, but one could never know if and when they''d strike again.  Poor Miller the Lifeguard, not a scrap of him was ever found after that day, the day the Sandpipers struck.', '2008-10-05 18:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993601, 725343, 97166, '<td valign="top">She grinned as best she could, but silently cursed the photographer for taking so long.  This thing was HEAVY, and she was about to topple backwards.  Did nobody care? <br/> <br/>"Just about, give me a smile, just about, one more second..."<br/> <br/>She grinned as best she could.  She was going to kill him.</td>', 'She grinned as best she could, but silently cursed the photographer for taking so long.  This thing was HEAVY, and she was about to topple backwards.  Did nobody care?  "Just about, give me a smile, just about, one more second..." She grinned as best she could.  She was going to kill him.', '2008-10-05 18:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993604, 727163, 97166, '<td valign="top">In a tribute never seen before, the universe aligned to pay respects to Bob Marley.</td>', 'In a tribute never seen before, the universe aligned to pay respects to Bob Marley.', '2008-10-05 18:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993608, 726426, 97166, '<td valign="top">Pineighchio suddenly gasped as The White Fairy touched him with her wand.  Since his creation at the hands of the old, gentle chess master, he''d been a wooden knight that only had one dream.<br/> <br/>Today, his dream was a reality.<br/> <br/>"I am a real horse!" He cried.</td>', 'Pineighchio suddenly gasped as The White Fairy touched him with her wand.  Since his creation at the hands of the old, gentle chess master, he''d been a wooden knight that only had one dream. Today, his dream was a reality. "I am a real horse!" He cried.', '2008-10-05 19:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993610, 724801, 97166, '<td valign="top">Marge was shocked when her assailant suddenly reached in and beeped her nose. <br/> <br/>"Who''s a good little mugging victim? Who is? You are!" *beep*.<br/> <br/>The assailant ran off giggling, and Marge just continued to stand there shocked.  He ... he hadn''t even taken anything.</td>', 'Marge was shocked when her assailant suddenly reached in and beeped her nose.  "Who''s a good little mugging victim? Who is? You are!" *beep*. The assailant ran off giggling, and Marge just continued to stand there shocked.  He ... he hadn''t even taken anything.', '2008-10-05 19:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993612, 719642, 97166, '<td valign="top">They weren''t going to lose this time.  For years they''d come into this little dive.  The food was good, the service better, but the reason for their faithful patronage was simple, the staring contest with the shop''s mascot, Henry, a box of Cereal with a frog painted on the side.<br/> <br/>Moments, later, cursing but laughing, the men congratulated Henry on yet another win.  They''d get that frog one day!</td>', 'They weren''t going to lose this time.  For years they''d come into this little dive.  The food was good, the service better, but the reason for their faithful patronage was simple, the staring contest with the shop''s mascot, Henry, a box of Cereal with a frog painted on the side. Moments, later, cursing but laughing, the men congratulated Henry on yet another win.  They''d get that frog one day!', '2008-10-05 19:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993615, 724872, 97166, '<td valign="top">Few people understand that the contemplations of the turtle are some of the most meaningful and complex in the entire universe.<br/> <br/>Fewer still understand that their day is coming.</td>', 'Few people understand that the contemplations of the turtle are some of the most meaningful and complex in the entire universe. Fewer still understand that their day is coming.', '2008-10-05 19:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993616, 725914, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was one thing to have a parent that was a photographer, thought Rose, but it is entirely another to have a parent that was a photographer and a professional clown. <br/> <br/>Rose scowled and plotted her revenge, as her friends stood just off frame and laughed amongst themselves.</td>', 'It was one thing to have a parent that was a photographer, thought Rose, but it is entirely another to have a parent that was a photographer and a professional clown.  Rose scowled and plotted her revenge, as her friends stood just off frame and laughed amongst themselves.', '2008-10-05 19:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993617, 727089, 97166, '<td valign="top">Dr. Benson uttered a scream shortly after asking Igor to open wide.  No matter what the pay, he promised himself shortly after, downing a flask of brandy, he would never take a job in Transylvania again!</td>', 'Dr. Benson uttered a scream shortly after asking Igor to open wide.  No matter what the pay, he promised himself shortly after, downing a flask of brandy, he would never take a job in Transylvania again!', '2008-10-05 19:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993620, 727172, 97166, '<td valign="top">After the fire of aught twelve, nobody questioned why Frank had as many, personal appendages, as he did.  Because one survived, Frank went on to father many young Lilies, and his family line became a legend.</td>', 'After the fire of aught twelve, nobody questioned why Frank had as many, personal appendages, as he did.  Because one survived, Frank went on to father many young Lilies, and his family line became a legend.', '2008-10-05 19:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4993623, 726633, 97166, '<td valign="top">Although it was considered amusing at the time, the ritual dance that Jenny had developed during her showers, it became apparent as the years passed that perhaps it wasn''t just a funny childhood thing.<br/> <br/>On her 20th birthday, when the skies opened up, and hell rained down, nobody was amused at all.</td>', 'Although it was considered amusing at the time, the ritual dance that Jenny had developed during her showers, it became apparent as the years passed that perhaps it wasn''t just a funny childhood thing. On her 20th birthday, when the skies opened up, and hell rained down, nobody was amused at all.', '2008-10-05 19:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
