(4994606, 721515, 58452, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Hahn work so in fairness I''ll not vote on it. I love the touch of Aspen Glow on the peak and it''s reflection. Interest is added by the matching lines of the sky and the perspective lines of the trees. A touch dark for my tastes but that''s just a little nit pic. Congrats on a beautiful landscape.</td>', 'This looks like a Hahn work so in fairness I''ll not vote on it. I love the touch of Aspen Glow on the peak and it''s reflection. Interest is added by the matching lines of the sky and the perspective lines of the trees. A touch dark for my tastes but that''s just a little nit pic. Congrats on a beautiful landscape.', '2008-10-06 09:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
