(4995789, 721352, 97166, '<td valign="top">Scrappy looked her best that day.  She''d just received a new gift, a precious collar in her favorite color.  The master''s knew how to show their love, and she was oh so proud of it. Now, pausing from her play, and throwing a whimsical look at Mrs. Master, she knew she''d cemented her place here, and won their love forever.<br/> <br/>Also, it was just about supper-time, and she was hoping for Gravy Train.</td>', 'Scrappy looked her best that day.  She''d just received a new gift, a precious collar in her favorite color.  The master''s knew how to show their love, and she was oh so proud of it. Now, pausing from her play, and throwing a whimsical look at Mrs. Master, she knew she''d cemented her place here, and won their love forever. Also, it was just about supper-time, and she was hoping for Gravy Train.', '2008-10-06 21:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
