(4996069, 721773, 35804, '<td valign="top">I think I can hear the buzz of the wings...really nice capture.</td>', 'I think I can hear the buzz of the wings...really nice capture.', '2008-10-06 23:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996071, 717102, 35804, '<td valign="top">...that...is...so...cool...Aerodynamics be damned!</td>', '...that...is...so...cool...Aerodynamics be damned!', '2008-10-06 23:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996079, 727184, 35804, '<td valign="top">This would look great <b>HUGE</b> and on a wall. Love the simple B&amp;W breakdown....I just can''t get over that eye...super cool.</td>', 'This would look great HUGE and on a wall. Love the simple B&W breakdown....I just can''t get over that eye...super cool.', '2008-10-06 23:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996090, 726179, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to move on from this photograph, I want to stay and linger...the light, the subtle color, the textures...a lovely bit of summer''s end captured.</td>', 'It''s hard to move on from this photograph, I want to stay and linger...the light, the subtle color, the textures...a lovely bit of summer''s end captured.', '2008-10-06 23:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996104, 718215, 35804, '<td valign="top">Oh...this is really nice...really <i>really</i> nice. A veritable kaleidoscope of color, but not so much so that it makes my head hurt. Excellent work here.</td>', 'Oh...this is really nice...really really nice. A veritable kaleidoscope of color, but not so much so that it makes my head hurt. Excellent work here.', '2008-10-06 23:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996106, 724139, 91614, '<td valign="top">Wow i wish i could vote on this image. I''d give it a 10! I just love reflections. And the composition and colors are great. Not sure what the title means though... lol :)</td>', 'Wow i wish i could vote on this image. I''d give it a 10! I just love reflections. And the composition and colors are great. Not sure what the title means though... lol :)', '2008-10-06 23:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996108, 725895, 91614, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great reflections. Very intriguing.</td>', 'Wow. Great reflections. Very intriguing.', '2008-10-06 23:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996133, 724139, 97166, '<td valign="top">When Erik the Diminutive set out to conquer the world, he should have taken into consideration the size of the world, and his boat.  <br/> <br/>Not to mention that whole "army" business.</td>', 'When Erik the Diminutive set out to conquer the world, he should have taken into consideration the size of the world, and his boat.   Not to mention that whole "army" business.', '2008-10-07 00:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996135, 723119, 97166, '<td valign="top">Neo didn''t consider the problems with taking acid while trying to watch The Matrix.</td>', 'Neo didn''t consider the problems with taking acid while trying to watch The Matrix.', '2008-10-07 00:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996138, 725191, 97166, '<td valign="top">After the rise and fall of the Seattle Garage Band scene,  Boys with Loud Toys decided to start a new craze, the Detroit Auto Worker''s Locker Room scene.<br/> <br/>It never did become as much of a success.</td>', 'After the rise and fall of the Seattle Garage Band scene,  Boys with Loud Toys decided to start a new craze, the Detroit Auto Worker''s Locker Room scene. It never did become as much of a success.', '2008-10-07 00:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996140, 725342, 97166, '<td valign="top">Little did Lil'' Davey realize that he was being led, not to the Happy Fun Party that the other boys told him he was going, but to be sacrificed as part of an ancient and most evil ritual.  <br/> <br/>It was only when the eyes of Danny and Bobby started to glow, that Davey started to panic.</td>', 'Little did Lil'' Davey realize that he was being led, not to the Happy Fun Party that the other boys told him he was going, but to be sacrificed as part of an ancient and most evil ritual.   It was only when the eyes of Danny and Bobby started to glow, that Davey started to panic.', '2008-10-07 00:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996148, 726797, 97166, '<td valign="top">As baby Billy nursed with his mother, she sighed.  She was hoping this wouldn''t happen, but it had.  How was she going to explain the color of his skin to his father?  If only that weekend in Mexico hadn''t happened!</td>', 'As baby Billy nursed with his mother, she sighed.  She was hoping this wouldn''t happen, but it had.  How was she going to explain the color of his skin to his father?  If only that weekend in Mexico hadn''t happened!', '2008-10-07 00:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996159, 721066, 97166, '<td valign="top">Thomas leaned over and whispered to his brother, "hey, Carl, how do you spell friends?" <br/> <br/>Carl just shook his head and continued to gaze off into the sky.  Little brothers can be so annoying.</td>', 'Thomas leaned over and whispered to his brother, "hey, Carl, how do you spell friends?"  Carl just shook his head and continued to gaze off into the sky.  Little brothers can be so annoying.', '2008-10-07 00:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996166, 724523, 97166, '<td valign="top">The morning after, with a surrealistic glow to the sunrise, only the palm trees remained.  Despite all the claims to the contrary, Humanity didn''t destroy the earth with their massive weapons, only themselves.</td>', 'The morning after, with a surrealistic glow to the sunrise, only the palm trees remained.  Despite all the claims to the contrary, Humanity didn''t destroy the earth with their massive weapons, only themselves.', '2008-10-07 00:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996170, 726786, 97166, '<td valign="top">Bobby had had enough, and finally turned around and screamed at the other boys to quit calling him names.  He''d had enough with "Hairy Head" and "Brown Boy", it wasn''t his fault he didn''t reach puberty as fast as they. He''d do it eventually, why couldn''t they just... leave... him... ALONE!</td>', 'Bobby had had enough, and finally turned around and screamed at the other boys to quit calling him names.  He''d had enough with "Hairy Head" and "Brown Boy", it wasn''t his fault he didn''t reach puberty as fast as they. He''d do it eventually, why couldn''t they just... leave... him... ALONE!', '2008-10-07 00:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996176, 725802, 97166, '<td valign="top">... and in the far reaches of the earth, Gandalf amused himself in his old age by continuing to put animal heads in the waves.<br/> <br/>He just wish that today, there had been a surfer to scare.</td>', '... and in the far reaches of the earth, Gandalf amused himself in his old age by continuing to put animal heads in the waves. He just wish that today, there had been a surfer to scare.', '2008-10-07 00:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996180, 727094, 97166, '<td valign="top">As they finished up the session, little Devon got a round of laughter out of everyone by finally declaring, "Are we done yet mom, I''m cold and I gotta go POTTY!"</td>', 'As they finished up the session, little Devon got a round of laughter out of everyone by finally declaring, "Are we done yet mom, I''m cold and I gotta go POTTY!"', '2008-10-07 00:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996185, 727138, 97166, '<td valign="top">Sadly, the first few attempts to reach outer-space went horribly, horribly wrong.<br/> <br/>They found out that the Milky Way wasn''t actually milky in a very wrong way.</td>', 'Sadly, the first few attempts to reach outer-space went horribly, horribly wrong. They found out that the Milky Way wasn''t actually milky in a very wrong way.', '2008-10-07 00:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996208, 725902, 97166, '<td valign="top">He stopped.  It was as if he was hit by a bus of love.  There she was, the bug of his dreams.  <br/> <br/>He tilted his head, she tilted hers. He winked, she returned it.  He smiled, she smiled back. <br/> <br/>It was a love for the ages, and a tragedy never matched.</td>', 'He stopped.  It was as if he was hit by a bus of love.  There she was, the bug of his dreams.   He tilted his head, she tilted hers. He winked, she returned it.  He smiled, she smiled back.  It was a love for the ages, and a tragedy never matched.', '2008-10-07 00:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996222, 725523, 98219, '<td valign="top">Incredible tones.  Washed out in some areas... maybe on purpose.  Love the shadows!</td>', 'Incredible tones.  Washed out in some areas... maybe on purpose.  Love the shadows!', '2008-10-07 00:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996224, 726426, 98219, '<td valign="top">Your majesty.....  Thats what I want to say when I look at this picture.</td>', 'Your majesty.....  Thats what I want to say when I look at this picture.', '2008-10-07 00:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
