(4996330, 717620, 33672, '<td valign="top">A nice piece of the county fair. Great tones. and an outstanding comp.</td>', 'A nice piece of the county fair. Great tones. and an outstanding comp.', '2008-10-07 02:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996331, 717092, 33672, '<td valign="top">Really nice tones. THe POV draws you in. I like that.</td>', 'Really nice tones. THe POV draws you in. I like that.', '2008-10-07 02:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996365, 727191, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo which would have also made a great abstract entry a challenge or two ago. Great color, a dynamic flow, interesting composition ... I could go on but in short ... Well Done!</td>', 'Wonderful photo which would have also made a great abstract entry a challenge or two ago. Great color, a dynamic flow, interesting composition ... I could go on but in short ... Well Done!', '2008-10-07 02:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996369, 726741, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and a well captured photo. I like the energy of the pose and how you cropped it to maximize the composition. It feels a bit over smoothed to me, and while I can imagine a model this perfect, the probability seems low and a flaw or two would enhance the photo. I gave it a great score so don''t sweat the critique.</td>', 'Beautiful model and a well captured photo. I like the energy of the pose and how you cropped it to maximize the composition. It feels a bit over smoothed to me, and while I can imagine a model this perfect, the probability seems low and a flaw or two would enhance the photo. I gave it a great score so don''t sweat the critique.', '2008-10-07 03:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996371, 726920, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like that this photo captures a lovely model with a few flaws in her skin and a nose that only the French could love. These characterists make her real, and believable, and lovely in her own skin. Very well done!<br/> <br/>Oh, and the photo is well composed, shot and presented. Thanks for letting us "see" her!</td>', 'I like that this photo captures a lovely model with a few flaws in her skin and a nose that only the French could love. These characterists make her real, and believable, and lovely in her own skin. Very well done! Oh, and the photo is well composed, shot and presented. Thanks for letting us "see" her!', '2008-10-07 03:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996372, 726859, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am stunned by your photo. It is perhaps "best of show." I love the "human interest" of this photo. Congratulations on a superb image!</td>', 'I am stunned by your photo. It is perhaps "best of show." I love the "human interest" of this photo. Congratulations on a superb image!', '2008-10-07 03:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996378, 726882, 41337, '<td valign="top">The technicals are good so obviously you know how to use your equipment. However, to be honest I''ll forget about this photo rather quickly because there simply isn''t anything unique about it.<br/> <br/>ETA: Well I didn''t forget my comment which was probably too harsh so I apologize for that. Let me add that this is a striking image. The eagle has a very strong presence in the composition, which is stronger than most so in that regard and it''s overall technicals, it stands out. <br/> <br/>The main reason for my comment earlier is while this is a strong image that can stand out from a technical standpoint it doesn''t stand out from a substance/newness standpoint which is also needed for an image to have lasting appeal. Anyway, just thought I clarify. Good luck.</td>', 'The technicals are good so obviously you know how to use your equipment. However, to be honest I''ll forget about this photo rather quickly because there simply isn''t anything unique about it. ETA: Well I didn''t forget my comment which was probably too harsh so I apologize for that. Let me add that this is a striking image. The eagle has a very strong presence in the composition, which is stronger than most so in that regard and it''s overall technicals, it stands out.  The main reason for my comment earlier is while this is a strong image that can stand out from a technical standpoint it doesn''t stand out from a substance/newness standpoint which is also needed for an image to have lasting appeal. Anyway, just thought I clarify. Good luck.', '2008-10-07 03:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996379, 726887, 18197, '<td valign="top">What I like best in your image is that you have captured an "attitude" beautifully. Or sure, you started with a lovely model, and the composition is terrific, and the focus is spot on, the lighting is dynamite, the colors are arresting, ... so you got off to a good start, and I could go on if I wanted you to become full of yourself. But with all that, you delivered an emotional payload with the photo which I like very much. Congratulations.</td>', 'What I like best in your image is that you have captured an "attitude" beautifully. Or sure, you started with a lovely model, and the composition is terrific, and the focus is spot on, the lighting is dynamite, the colors are arresting, ... so you got off to a good start, and I could go on if I wanted you to become full of yourself. But with all that, you delivered an emotional payload with the photo which I like very much. Congratulations.', '2008-10-07 03:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996381, 725814, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail, exquisitely focused and composed, and well presented. Thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful detail, exquisitely focused and composed, and well presented. Thank you.', '2008-10-07 03:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996382, 727012, 45559, '<td valign="top">Hey Larus. Nice one here.</td>', 'Hey Larus. Nice one here.', '2008-10-07 03:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996383, 725743, 18197, '<td valign="top">I fear this photo will be under appreciated by DPC voters which would be a shame.<br/> <br/>It is an incredably well crafted landscape. Let me count the ways: 1) Subject; 2) Composition; 3) Focus and clarity; 4) Subtle colors; 5) Dynamic feel added by the mist; 6) Brilliant mix of foreground detail and background detail ... I''m going to stop counting ... but congratulations on a beautifully conceived, composed, executed, and presented image! Good luck in the voting.</td>', 'I fear this photo will be under appreciated by DPC voters which would be a shame. It is an incredably well crafted landscape. Let me count the ways: 1) Subject; 2) Composition; 3) Focus and clarity; 4) Subtle colors; 5) Dynamic feel added by the mist; 6) Brilliant mix of foreground detail and background detail ... I''m going to stop counting ... but congratulations on a beautifully conceived, composed, executed, and presented image! Good luck in the voting.', '2008-10-07 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4996384, 724145, 18197, '<td valign="top">I adore the abstract surreal feeling of this. Curved gradients are great. B&amp;W was a good choice. Maybe not to a broad escetic, but among my few 10''s for the challenge!</td>', 'I adore the abstract surreal feeling of this. Curved gradients are great. B&W was a good choice. Maybe not to a broad escetic, but among my few 10''s for the challenge!', '2008-10-07 03:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
