(4996708, 726722, 94597, '<td valign="top">In a message dated 07/10/2008 11:57:58 GMT Daylight Time, message@dpchallenge.com writes:<br/>DPChallenge user Rino63 has sent you the following private message:<br/> <br/>hi, sorry if I disturb you in your private email. I received a comment from you for my photo "Royal palace" in the free study challenge. the text of your comment is ff, please could you tell me what means ff?<br/>thank you  for your comment.<br/>Gennaro<br/> <br/> <br/>Apologies, was typing some random letters to see how the system worked, <br/> <br/>CL<br/> <br/>But while I am here, I must say it is a great photo. Wher is the building?</td>', 'In a message dated 07/10/2008 11:57:58 GMT Daylight Time, message@dpchallenge.com writes:DPChallenge user Rino63 has sent you the following private message: hi, sorry if I disturb you in your private email. I received a comment from you for my photo "Royal palace" in the free study challenge. the text of your comment is ff, please could you tell me what means ff?thank you  for your comment.Gennaro  Apologies, was typing some random letters to see how the system worked,  CL But while I am here, I must say it is a great photo. Wher is the building?', '2008-10-07 11:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
