(4997084, 727123, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Excellent.  Love those colors.  Like your framing.  He looks like he needs a name (looks like a he)... maybe George...  Big print of him on the wall looking at you each time you walked past...</td>', '9 - Excellent.  Love those colors.  Like your framing.  He looks like he needs a name (looks like a he)... maybe George...  Big print of him on the wall looking at you each time you walked past...', '2008-10-07 16:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
