(4997605, 725342, 29011, '<td valign="top">Indeed magical and fairytale like. I never get tired from deer pics like this. It''s so very well done. If I had the tiniest of nitpicks ;) that''d be the little spark or glitter in their eyes. If it''s from the camera flash, I''d clone those out.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-08 00:07:28.</i></td>', 'Indeed magical and fairytale like. I never get tired from deer pics like this. It''s so very well done. If I had the tiniest of nitpicks ;) that''d be the little spark or glitter in their eyes. If it''s from the camera flash, I''d clone those out.', '2008-10-07 21:54:04.000000', '2008-10-08 01:07:28.000000', 1),
(4997612, 726764, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was an affliction well known in the world for the Double-Headed People. On occasion, one will be born with heads that simply cannot get along.  One will be liberal, the other conservative. One will be perpetually happy, the other will be perpetually blue.  One will be a morning head, the other a night owl.<br/> <br/>In the case of Eve and Regina, however, years of conflict finally led to a sad and tragic ending.  As Regina finally ended her other head''s existence, she screamed in triumph. Finally, finally, she would be free, and would never hear "No, Tom CRUISE is cuter!" ever again.</td>', 'It was an affliction well known in the world for the Double-Headed People. On occasion, one will be born with heads that simply cannot get along.  One will be liberal, the other conservative. One will be perpetually happy, the other will be perpetually blue.  One will be a morning head, the other a night owl. In the case of Eve and Regina, however, years of conflict finally led to a sad and tragic ending.  As Regina finally ended her other head''s existence, she screamed in triumph. Finally, finally, she would be free, and would never hear "No, Tom CRUISE is cuter!" ever again.', '2008-10-07 21:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997616, 726427, 97166, '<td valign="top">Peter lifted his head as the train rocketed off into the distance. Sighing heavily, he put his cheek into his palm and flicked a rock away from him.  What was wrong with him?  Why was he so useless? <br/> <br/>He couldn''t even get himself run over by a train properly.</td>', 'Peter lifted his head as the train rocketed off into the distance. Sighing heavily, he put his cheek into his palm and flicked a rock away from him.  What was wrong with him?  Why was he so useless?  He couldn''t even get himself run over by a train properly.', '2008-10-07 21:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997621, 726954, 97166, '<td valign="top">As she wandered the desolate landscape, she could only internally curse herself for being so silly.  <br/> <br/>Next time, she thought, when given the choice between a backpack full of food and a coat, or a brightly colored bath toy and a nightie, perhaps choosing the bath toy and nightie wouldn''t be entirely smart!<br/> <br/>Sighing, she began her trek once more.</td>', 'As she wandered the desolate landscape, she could only internally curse herself for being so silly.   Next time, she thought, when given the choice between a backpack full of food and a coat, or a brightly colored bath toy and a nightie, perhaps choosing the bath toy and nightie wouldn''t be entirely smart! Sighing, she began her trek once more.', '2008-10-07 22:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997629, 727012, 97166, '<td valign="top">Matthew had a terrible affliction.  Whenever it rained, he was uncontrollably compelled to go stand outside in it and pretend to be a film noir super-hero.</td>', 'Matthew had a terrible affliction.  Whenever it rained, he was uncontrollably compelled to go stand outside in it and pretend to be a film noir super-hero.', '2008-10-07 22:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
