(4997642, 726842, 97166, '<td valign="top">Todd wanted so much to live a live of excitement as a small time mugger.  How unfortunate for him then, that he was born with the eyes that he had, for they glowed with an inner light that was extremely recognizable, no matter how dark the hood he wore. <br/> <br/>It also didn''t help that all the ladies he tried to mug fell madly in love with him and then started to stalk him.<br/> <br/>It just wasn''t fair.</td>', 'Todd wanted so much to live a live of excitement as a small time mugger.  How unfortunate for him then, that he was born with the eyes that he had, for they glowed with an inner light that was extremely recognizable, no matter how dark the hood he wore.  It also didn''t help that all the ladies he tried to mug fell madly in love with him and then started to stalk him. It just wasn''t fair.', '2008-10-07 22:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
