(4997729, 726940, 97166, '<td valign="top">"Hey George"<br/> <br/>"Hey Ralph"<br/> <br/>"Out fishing again today George?"<br/> <br/>"Ayuh.  You?"<br/> <br/>"Oh, no. Not me today. Was taken out for a bit more''n that I''m afraid.  Y''know Don Chico yuh?  See, he took me out today. With''n a... package."<br/> <br/>"Oh, Ralph, you don''t mean.."<br/> <br/>"S''right George, he finally did it.  Poor thing."<br/> <br/>"Oh ayuh. Sad times, sad times."<br/> <br/>"That they are George. That they are."</td>', '"Hey George" "Hey Ralph" "Out fishing again today George?" "Ayuh.  You?" "Oh, no. Not me today. Was taken out for a bit more''n that I''m afraid.  Y''know Don Chico yuh?  See, he took me out today. With''n a... package." "Oh, Ralph, you don''t mean.." "S''right George, he finally did it.  Poor thing." "Oh ayuh. Sad times, sad times." "That they are George. That they are."', '2008-10-07 22:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
