(4997886, 726858, 97166, '<td valign="top">She glanced up at him, as he tried to hurry on his way, but the look stopped him. <br/> <br/>"Please sir, I''ve lost my way, can you help me?"<br/> <br/>His usual revulsion at these street urchins began to rise, but for some reason he was able to overcome it this time.  With a slight scowl, he nodded and asked if where she lived, if anywhere.   She mentioned a street, one that he recognized, and so for whatever reason, he decided to lead her there.  As they went, she babbled on about this and that. At first, he simply nodded, but as they went her voice seemed to work on him somehow.  He found himself answering, in brief at first, but then at length.  By the time they arrived at their destination, he had found himself even starting certain small conversations.  It astounded him.<br/> <br/>As they turned on her street, a woman came running up, crying and grabbing her daughter.  She showered her with hugs and kisses, and then turned to the man, thanking him profusely for bringing her home.  At an invite for dinner, he found himself unable to say no, and was welcomed into their small and comfortable, if very rag-tag and poor, home.<br/> <br/>It was the beginning of a life-long friendship, started because of the momentary decision to turn away from instinct and do what was right.<br/> <br/>For all the rest of his life he remembered the face in the rain, and he was never an unkind man again.</td>', 'She glanced up at him, as he tried to hurry on his way, but the look stopped him.  "Please sir, I''ve lost my way, can you help me?" His usual revulsion at these street urchins began to rise, but for some reason he was able to overcome it this time.  With a slight scowl, he nodded and asked if where she lived, if anywhere.   She mentioned a street, one that he recognized, and so for whatever reason, he decided to lead her there.  As they went, she babbled on about this and that. At first, he simply nodded, but as they went her voice seemed to work on him somehow.  He found himself answering, in brief at first, but then at length.  By the time they arrived at their destination, he had found himself even starting certain small conversations.  It astounded him. As they turned on her street, a woman came running up, crying and grabbing her daughter.  She showered her with hugs and kisses, and then turned to the man, thanking him profusely for bringing her home.  At an invite for dinner, he found himself unable to say no, and was welcomed into their small and comfortable, if very rag-tag and poor, home. It was the beginning of a life-long friendship, started because of the momentary decision to turn away from instinct and do what was right. For all the rest of his life he remembered the face in the rain, and he was never an unkind man again.', '2008-10-08 00:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997888, 727052, 42495, '<td valign="top">So simple and yet so beautiful.  Back for a bump and a fave.</td>', 'So simple and yet so beautiful.  Back for a bump and a fave.', '2008-10-08 00:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997890, 721451, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was with a bitter heart that Herbie the Love Bug drove yet another client to his destination in the pouring rain.  He''d fallen so far since he''d gone Bananas. <br/> <br/>With a sigh, he drove on.</td>', 'It was with a bitter heart that Herbie the Love Bug drove yet another client to his destination in the pouring rain.  He''d fallen so far since he''d gone Bananas.  With a sigh, he drove on.', '2008-10-08 00:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997891, 725523, 42495, '<td valign="top">Back for a bump - excellent job on the lighting and pp.</td>', 'Back for a bump - excellent job on the lighting and pp.', '2008-10-08 00:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997894, 727060, 97166, '<td valign="top">Jordan fought hard to roll down the rest of the beach, desperately wanting to reach the shore.  All his life he''d been here, appearing one night in the middle of a storm.  Now, he wished to see more of the world.  <br/> <br/>Another effort, another roll, another inch toward the sea, when suddenly he heard, "Dad! There''s a great log there, it''ll be perfect!"<br/> <br/>Jordan''s screams went tragically unnoticed.</td>', 'Jordan fought hard to roll down the rest of the beach, desperately wanting to reach the shore.  All his life he''d been here, appearing one night in the middle of a storm.  Now, he wished to see more of the world.   Another effort, another roll, another inch toward the sea, when suddenly he heard, "Dad! There''s a great log there, it''ll be perfect!" Jordan''s screams went tragically unnoticed.', '2008-10-08 00:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997897, 727138, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like your angle here and the sense of motion captured.  What kept me from scoring it higher is the blackish water and lack of space for them to row into.</td>', 'I like your angle here and the sense of motion captured.  What kept me from scoring it higher is the blackish water and lack of space for them to row into.', '2008-10-08 00:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997899, 721302, 97166, '<td valign="top">Kyle had been here for centuries.  His beacon had lit the night. His presence the savior of so many.  Now, the world had moved on.  The sea had changed, the ships had gone. <br/> <br/>As the sun set on the day, Kyle knew it also set on his lifetime, on his legacy.<br/> <br/>With a final flash, his light burnt out, and in that twilight his legend slipped into the past.</td>', 'Kyle had been here for centuries.  His beacon had lit the night. His presence the savior of so many.  Now, the world had moved on.  The sea had changed, the ships had gone.  As the sun set on the day, Kyle knew it also set on his lifetime, on his legacy. With a final flash, his light burnt out, and in that twilight his legend slipped into the past.', '2008-10-08 00:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997900, 721066, 42495, '<td valign="top">I don''t doubt they''re friends, but that''s hard for me to discern from the picture.  They seem to be looking at slightly different things and not engaged with either other.  The tint of the sepia is a bit strong, IMO, but the vignette adds a nostalgic touch.</td>', 'I don''t doubt they''re friends, but that''s hard for me to discern from the picture.  They seem to be looking at slightly different things and not engaged with either other.  The tint of the sepia is a bit strong, IMO, but the vignette adds a nostalgic touch.', '2008-10-08 00:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997902, 719814, 41337, '<td valign="top">You''re good. She even looks like Elizabeth Taylor. My third favorite in this challenge. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657190" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657190.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657190.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657190.gif"/></a></td>', 'You''re good. She even looks like Elizabeth Taylor. My third favorite in this challenge.  ', '2008-10-08 00:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997904, 725588, 42495, '<td valign="top">Composition is strong and good job on the lighting.  I think the high noise detracts from the image - it''s no so apparent on the animal but is in the background.</td>', 'Composition is strong and good job on the lighting.  I think the high noise detracts from the image - it''s no so apparent on the animal but is in the background.', '2008-10-08 00:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997905, 721318, 97166, '<td valign="top">As she lay her head in her hand, giving one final smile, she was also weary. Although she loved being in front of the camera, she was missing her favorite show, and her legs were sore, and her underwear was riding, and she was getting kind of hungry and she really liked those fruit snacks you know those ones that looked like dinosaurs and maybe she kind of wanted peanut butter crackers but maybe not because they were out of milk and boy daddy is taking a long time with this shot and I wonder what Haley is doing right now maybe she''s playing at the park boy I''d love to go the park right now I''ll have to ask oh look there''s a fly in here I sure don''t like flies what time is it I wonder if...<br/> <br/></td>', 'As she lay her head in her hand, giving one final smile, she was also weary. Although she loved being in front of the camera, she was missing her favorite show, and her legs were sore, and her underwear was riding, and she was getting kind of hungry and she really liked those fruit snacks you know those ones that looked like dinosaurs and maybe she kind of wanted peanut butter crackers but maybe not because they were out of milk and boy daddy is taking a long time with this shot and I wonder what Haley is doing right now maybe she''s playing at the park boy I''d love to go the park right now I''ll have to ask oh look there''s a fly in here I sure don''t like flies what time is it I wonder if... ', '2008-10-08 00:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997906, 723141, 42495, '<td valign="top">The upper half really works for me but the lower right quadrant has just a bit too much blue negative space.  IMO, if you cropped about 1/5 off bottom and right it would make for a much stronger composition.  I''d love to see more of the structures on the left - it looks like you really got the exposure right.</td>', 'The upper half really works for me but the lower right quadrant has just a bit too much blue negative space.  IMO, if you cropped about 1/5 off bottom and right it would make for a much stronger composition.  I''d love to see more of the structures on the left - it looks like you really got the exposure right.', '2008-10-08 00:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997907, 725833, 42495, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential and I like how the subject is intimate with the camera and hence viewer.  I would have cropped a bit higher and perhaps gotten his eyes on a third.  Also, the bits of food (or whatever) around his face could have been cloned out.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential and I like how the subject is intimate with the camera and hence viewer.  I would have cropped a bit higher and perhaps gotten his eyes on a third.  Also, the bits of food (or whatever) around his face could have been cloned out.', '2008-10-08 00:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997911, 727000, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really nicely composed. Nice lines. Would only suggest a slight crop off the bottom so we only see the yellow part of the arches.</td>', 'Really nicely composed. Nice lines. Would only suggest a slight crop off the bottom so we only see the yellow part of the arches.', '2008-10-08 00:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997912, 726983, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the lighting ,composition and treatment. Pitty the focus isn''t tack on. Still nice catch of the pose. They seem kinda curious when the camera comes out of the bag ;)</td>', 'Really like the lighting ,composition and treatment. Pitty the focus isn''t tack on. Still nice catch of the pose. They seem kinda curious when the camera comes out of the bag ;)', '2008-10-08 00:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997913, 723223, 42495, '<td valign="top">Your message certainly comes through and I really like the B&amp;W portion of the picture, but it''s the boots that throw me off.  If they''re intended to be on the male subject, they look like they''re not.  If they''re not intended to be on the male subject, they look like they were placed to be.  I know it''s a nitpick, but pulls me away from the other part of the photo.</td>', 'Your message certainly comes through and I really like the B&W portion of the picture, but it''s the boots that throw me off.  If they''re intended to be on the male subject, they look like they''re not.  If they''re not intended to be on the male subject, they look like they were placed to be.  I know it''s a nitpick, but pulls me away from the other part of the photo.', '2008-10-08 00:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997916, 721798, 61651, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to look at this one again - engrossing abstract, well exposed.  10</td>', 'I''ve come back to look at this one again - engrossing abstract, well exposed.  10', '2008-10-08 00:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997917, 725506, 42495, '<td valign="top">This has a nice ethereal quality to it, but the blown out sun just begs for the viewer''s eye.  This would probably work well in HDR.</td>', 'This has a nice ethereal quality to it, but the blown out sun just begs for the viewer''s eye.  This would probably work well in HDR.', '2008-10-08 00:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997922, 725459, 61651, '<td valign="top">Tonal range is excellent, and the dreaminess you achieved here makes this something to look at for a long time.  Gotta love shallow DOF.  10</td>', 'Tonal range is excellent, and the dreaminess you achieved here makes this something to look at for a long time.  Gotta love shallow DOF.  10', '2008-10-08 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997928, 726858, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very appealing shot, and I like how there''s this slight smile playing at the edges of her expression, as if she''s not minding the downpour all that much.  Bumping to 10.</td>', 'Very appealing shot, and I like how there''s this slight smile playing at the edges of her expression, as if she''s not minding the downpour all that much.  Bumping to 10.', '2008-10-08 00:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997929, 719232, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and gets across texture very well.</td>', 'Nice detail and gets across texture very well.', '2008-10-08 00:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997930, 727032, 29011, '<td valign="top">Easily my favorite still life photo from the challenge. Most artistic and whatever effect you where going for, the end result is wonderful. I hope this does well.</td>', 'Easily my favorite still life photo from the challenge. Most artistic and whatever effect you where going for, the end result is wonderful. I hope this does well.', '2008-10-08 00:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997934, 725296, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very soothing, understated, quiet - quite like that morning, I imagine.  Well done.</td>', 'Very soothing, understated, quiet - quite like that morning, I imagine.  Well done.', '2008-10-08 00:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997939, 723155, 61651, '<td valign="top">Oversaturation works well here, almost turns your shot into a color abstract.</td>', 'Oversaturation works well here, almost turns your shot into a color abstract.', '2008-10-08 00:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997942, 726179, 29011, '<td valign="top">Such a busy composition. I think it works nicely here. The rather soft lighting does this shot really well. Nice detail and color(so natural). No nitpicks :)</td>', 'Such a busy composition. I think it works nicely here. The rather soft lighting does this shot really well. Nice detail and color(so natural). No nitpicks :)', '2008-10-08 00:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997946, 725461, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen - the arc of the stairway swings us towards the umbrella toter, which echoes the shape of the foreground element.  I''m envious.</td>', 'Nicely seen - the arc of the stairway swings us towards the umbrella toter, which echoes the shape of the foreground element.  I''m envious.', '2008-10-08 00:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997950, 726426, 29011, '<td valign="top">Such a classic shot done very well. Few nitpicks, top left corner, would like to see it completely black and whatever the color left in the shot should be desaturated.</td>', 'Such a classic shot done very well. Few nitpicks, top left corner, would like to see it completely black and whatever the color left in the shot should be desaturated.', '2008-10-08 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997952, 725729, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice and nostalgic, and this reminds me of so many times viewing actual film movies at home or in school.  I wonder how this would look in B&amp;W or sepia.</td>', 'Nice and nostalgic, and this reminds me of so many times viewing actual film movies at home or in school.  I wonder how this would look in B&W or sepia.', '2008-10-08 00:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997954, 727125, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, and nicely "imperfect" with her hair blowing around her face like that.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, and nicely "imperfect" with her hair blowing around her face like that.', '2008-10-08 00:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997957, 717458, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the slightly washed out coloring of this image - works for me.</td>', 'I like the slightly washed out coloring of this image - works for me.', '2008-10-08 00:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997964, 727032, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - I like the violet tones.</td>', 'Beautiful - I like the violet tones.', '2008-10-08 00:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997967, 725512, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really love the painterly look of this shot. So calm and serene. The colors are just perfect and I''m glad you didn''t decide to boost the sky colors or the rest of the shot any more, some might be enticed to do so. Very natural looking and appealing shot.</td>', 'Really love the painterly look of this shot. So calm and serene. The colors are just perfect and I''m glad you didn''t decide to boost the sky colors or the rest of the shot any more, some might be enticed to do so. Very natural looking and appealing shot.', '2008-10-08 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997975, 723597, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wow, a very strong image. Concern could be interpreted several ways in this photograph. In my top two.<br/> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657189" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657189.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657189.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657189.gif"/></a></td>', 'Wow, a very strong image. Concern could be interpreted several ways in this photograph. In my top two.  ', '2008-10-08 00:59:32.000000', NULL, 1);
