(4997999, 726024, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by K10DGuy:</b></div><hr/><i> The storm came up suddenly that day, and Kathy could never forgive herself for not being nearer to her dear Darren when the lightning struck.  It was not too many months later that Kathy threw herself to the cows in despair. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The first sentence is dang near true!  BIG storm with thunder and lightning caught me out in the open for a few minutes while I raced back to my vehicle.  All the while muttering to myself..."not good, not good carrying this 5 pound hunk of tripod metal...not good!".  :-P</td>', 'Originally posted by K10DGuy: The storm came up suddenly that day, and Kathy could never forgive herself for not being nearer to her dear Darren when the lightning struck.  It was not too many months later that Kathy threw herself to the cows in despair.  The first sentence is dang near true!  BIG storm with thunder and lightning caught me out in the open for a few minutes while I raced back to my vehicle.  All the while muttering to myself..."not good, not good carrying this 5 pound hunk of tripod metal...not good!".  :-P', '2008-10-08 01:08:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998000, 726015, 8891, '<td valign="top">Thought I recognized this beauty! Great shot, Scott! Big congrats on your top 20 finish and new PB!</td>', 'Thought I recognized this beauty! Great shot, Scott! Big congrats on your top 20 finish and new PB!', '2008-10-08 01:08:47.000000', NULL, 0),
