(4998034, 720841, 69325, '<td valign="top"><b><u>very</u></b> beautiful shot roz! you should be quite pleased with this, even if it didnt score like you hoped. this has commercial quality written all over it, i can easily see this as a poster in classrooms everywhere!<br/> <br/>eta: we may have been neck and neck at firts but you definitely pulled ahead, i am about 40 places behind you!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-08 00:17:16.</i></td>', 'very beautiful shot roz! you should be quite pleased with this, even if it didnt score like you hoped. this has commercial quality written all over it, i can easily see this as a poster in classrooms everywhere! eta: we may have been neck and neck at firts but you definitely pulled ahead, i am about 40 places behind you!', '2008-10-08 01:16:17.000000', '2008-10-08 01:17:16.000000', 0),
