(4998424, 724139, 68586, '<td valign="top">Ah - it''s that boat again ; - )<br/> <br/>Lovely feeling of depth to this shot and saturated colours, along with a (perhaps unwitting) tension thrown in, where you have an old style, old technology boat as your main focal point, with a backdrop of vapour trails in the sky from very modern technology ! adds a liitle extra something.</td>', 'Ah - it''s that boat again ; - ) Lovely feeling of depth to this shot and saturated colours, along with a (perhaps unwitting) tension thrown in, where you have an old style, old technology boat as your main focal point, with a backdrop of vapour trails in the sky from very modern technology ! adds a liitle extra something.', '2008-10-08 03:32:54.000000', NULL, 0),
