(4998510, 725533, 78455, '<td valign="top">I thought this one would do well! great capture and congrats on the red.</td>', 'I thought this one would do well! great capture and congrats on the red.', '2008-10-08 05:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998512, 721842, 78455, '<td valign="top">Nice processing on this...very well done! Congrats on the yellow!</td>', 'Nice processing on this...very well done! Congrats on the yellow!', '2008-10-08 05:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998515, 721877, 78455, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones in this mark and another fantastic deer shot!</td>', 'Lovely tones in this mark and another fantastic deer shot!', '2008-10-08 05:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998517, 720901, 36606, '<td valign="top">brilliant work. Love it. congrats</td>', 'brilliant work. Love it. congrats', '2008-10-08 06:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998521, 725976, 44877, '<td valign="top">So outstanding!!! Huge congrats on the awesome FS score. I absolutely love this.</td>', 'So outstanding!!! Huge congrats on the awesome FS score. I absolutely love this.', '2008-10-08 06:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998523, 720841, 44877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, Roz - great FS score!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, Roz - great FS score!', '2008-10-08 06:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998525, 725461, 44877, '<td valign="top">What a stunner. Congrats on the peer acknowledgment.</td>', 'What a stunner. Congrats on the peer acknowledgment.', '2008-10-08 06:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998528, 726956, 64568, '<td valign="top">Great shot mate ;-), love the position of the wings.</td>', 'Great shot mate ;-), love the position of the wings.', '2008-10-08 06:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998531, 726732, 67152, '<td valign="top">That big white thing sure can take some good photos, or is it you?  Outstanding stuff and it was a real gas to meet you and all the folks from the western side of VT at VINS.</td>', 'That big white thing sure can take some good photos, or is it you?  Outstanding stuff and it was a real gas to meet you and all the folks from the western side of VT at VINS.', '2008-10-08 06:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998537, 724950, 67152, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and excellent details - very well done. Where''s the snowy owl???</td>', 'Beautiful colors and excellent details - very well done. Where''s the snowy owl???', '2008-10-08 06:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998539, 721842, 32345, '<td valign="top">Congrats for the ribbon :) It''s a great picture</td>', 'Congrats for the ribbon :) It''s a great picture', '2008-10-08 06:53:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998544, 725118, 49109, '<td valign="top">I wonder what those dark areas in the foreground right and center are, looks like some weird editing  traces (maybe from cloning out your shadow?)<br/>The colors really seem to be a little off- The cropped house bothers me a bit, would have been better with an even wider angle or some steps backwards (if possible).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-08 06:03:46.</i></td>', 'I wonder what those dark areas in the foreground right and center are, looks like some weird editing  traces (maybe from cloning out your shadow?)The colors really seem to be a little off- The cropped house bothers me a bit, would have been better with an even wider angle or some steps backwards (if possible).', '2008-10-08 07:00:24.000000', '2008-10-08 07:03:46.000000', 0),
(4998545, 725118, 67152, '<td valign="top">David - I think you captured the wonderul low angle light very well here.  The warm tones, the richness of the details all works well in the photo.  In addition, the use of the roofline to mirror the mountain shows good compositional appeal.  With all that, the shadows on the road really hurt the image.  Also, the fact that the road looks a bit ''muddy'' from a details perspective did not help the DPC crowd.  <br/> <br/>I gave it a 6 for the comp and lighting perspective - but the road and shadows issues brought it down from the 8-9 I wanted to give it.</td>', 'David - I think you captured the wonderul low angle light very well here.  The warm tones, the richness of the details all works well in the photo.  In addition, the use of the roofline to mirror the mountain shows good compositional appeal.  With all that, the shadows on the road really hurt the image.  Also, the fact that the road looks a bit ''muddy'' from a details perspective did not help the DPC crowd.   I gave it a 6 for the comp and lighting perspective - but the road and shadows issues brought it down from the 8-9 I wanted to give it.', '2008-10-08 07:03:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998550, 726732, 16531, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot ,congrats on a new PB :)</td>', 'Outstanding shot ,congrats on a new PB :)', '2008-10-08 07:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998551, 725533, 36606, '<td valign="top">brilliant shot. Captures those feelings I rememeber as a child. congrats</td>', 'brilliant shot. Captures those feelings I rememeber as a child. congrats', '2008-10-08 07:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998552, 722584, 67152, '<td valign="top">Charlene - I really liked this image, gave it a 7 during voting.  The fact that we need the reflection to see her is outstanding...</td>', 'Charlene - I really liked this image, gave it a 7 during voting.  The fact that we need the reflection to see her is outstanding...', '2008-10-08 07:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998557, 720901, 67152, '<td valign="top">Outstanding work Andrew.  Easily in my top 3 for the challenge.  A work of art - and one that would make and outstanding print to give to the families of the ladder company.</td>', 'Outstanding work Andrew.  Easily in my top 3 for the challenge.  A work of art - and one that would make and outstanding print to give to the families of the ladder company.', '2008-10-08 07:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998562, 721877, 51538, '<td valign="top">You beat that Saberi guy at his own game here... nice one ;-)</td>', 'You beat that Saberi guy at his own game here... nice one ;-)', '2008-10-08 07:32:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998563, 725342, 51538, '<td valign="top">No stags, Alex.  That''s why Simms beat you at your own game ;-)  Nice one though...</td>', 'No stags, Alex.  That''s why Simms beat you at your own game ;-)  Nice one though...', '2008-10-08 07:33:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998566, 727184, 39850, '<td valign="top">Thank you both for the comments and understanding, glad you liked it.  Thanks to the other commenters too.</td>', 'Thank you both for the comments and understanding, glad you liked it.  Thanks to the other commenters too.', '2008-10-08 07:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998567, 722960, 51538, '<td valign="top">Thanks for sharing the details.  A very well executed idea...</td>', 'Thanks for sharing the details.  A very well executed idea...', '2008-10-08 07:37:03.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4998568, 727052, 51538, '<td valign="top">Did pretty well ;-)  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Did pretty well ;-)  Keep up the good work.', '2008-10-08 07:37:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998569, 724950, 16531, '<td valign="top">Very well done!Great colors</td>', 'Very well done!Great colors', '2008-10-08 07:37:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998572, 721628, 51538, '<td valign="top">Glad you entered this photo so I can enjoy it again and again...</td>', 'Glad you entered this photo so I can enjoy it again and again...', '2008-10-08 07:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998576, 719232, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is a sweet pastoral image.  Looks as if she has a wise eye too.  Knew a good photographer when she saw one ;-)  Lovely photo.</td>', 'That is a sweet pastoral image.  Looks as if she has a wise eye too.  Knew a good photographer when she saw one ;-)  Lovely photo.', '2008-10-08 07:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998579, 724873, 51538, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you bring a French eye for art to this challenge.  Makes a nice print, I think...</td>', 'I''m glad you bring a French eye for art to this challenge.  Makes a nice print, I think...', '2008-10-08 07:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998580, 726928, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites from this challenge.  So obviously from the Green and Pleasant Land too (my home).</td>', 'One of my favourites from this challenge.  So obviously from the Green and Pleasant Land too (my home).', '2008-10-08 07:41:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998581, 723617, 51538, '<td valign="top">Jason - very nice photo.  You must have some good ones in your family collection.</td>', 'Jason - very nice photo.  You must have some good ones in your family collection.', '2008-10-08 07:42:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998583, 725512, 51538, '<td valign="top">So the 5D and the 24-70 are responsible, as well as your early rising eye.  They work well in the countryside, don''t they.  Nice work.</td>', 'So the 5D and the 24-70 are responsible, as well as your early rising eye.  They work well in the countryside, don''t they.  Nice work.', '2008-10-08 07:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998584, 721877, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ah, Simms!  I had this one pinned down as Alex Saberi''s.  Excellent work, and in my personal top 5.</td>', 'Ah, Simms!  I had this one pinned down as Alex Saberi''s.  Excellent work, and in my personal top 5.', '2008-10-08 07:44:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998585, 726649, 32997, '<td valign="top">great shot, much more interesting than most in the challenge...</td>', 'great shot, much more interesting than most in the challenge...', '2008-10-08 07:44:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998588, 725512, 67152, '<td valign="top">Outstanding finish for an outstanding image.  Great job.</td>', 'Outstanding finish for an outstanding image.  Great job.', '2008-10-08 07:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998589, 721318, 51538, '<td valign="top">Came back to re-appreciate.  Lovely photo.</td>', 'Came back to re-appreciate.  Lovely photo.', '2008-10-08 07:46:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998590, 721451, 51538, '<td valign="top">A memorable shot from this challenge.  The news is a mixed blessing....  The old bug has a lot over the new model, in terms of nice looking machinery design...</td>', 'A memorable shot from this challenge.  The news is a mixed blessing....  The old bug has a lot over the new model, in terms of nice looking machinery design...', '2008-10-08 07:48:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998592, 726794, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites from this challenge (8 from me).  Glad you entered it.</td>', 'One of my favourites from this challenge (8 from me).  Glad you entered it.', '2008-10-08 07:49:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998596, 723892, 49773, '<td valign="top">Crop in tighter next time! ;-)<br/>Great light and excelent tonal range. Black &amp; white really suits it well!<br/></td>', 'Crop in tighter next time! ;-)Great light and excelent tonal range. Black & white really suits it well!', '2008-10-08 07:52:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998598, 727020, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well, you beat thousands of dollars worth of equipment with your cam phone.  Nice one.  A nice photo too, IMO.</td>', 'Well, you beat thousands of dollars worth of equipment with your cam phone.  Nice one.  A nice photo too, IMO.', '2008-10-08 07:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998599, 723892, 67152, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning use of light to capture the feeling.  Great stuff!</td>', 'Simply stunning use of light to capture the feeling.  Great stuff!', '2008-10-08 07:53:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998600, 725118, 51538, '<td valign="top">I voted a 6 and like it overall, colours and composition.  But it is hard to stand alone against some of the photos in such a challenge.  I think the grade was pretty good considering.</td>', 'I voted a 6 and like it overall, colours and composition.  But it is hard to stand alone against some of the photos in such a challenge.  I think the grade was pretty good considering.', '2008-10-08 07:54:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998601, 727077, 79955, '<td valign="top">This shot really ain''t bad at all, I actually gave you a 6. It is a very good shot, nicely composed. As the DOF is very shallow , your point of focus needs to be crisper , but this is difficult to achieve given you choice of subject and color tones.</td>', 'This shot really ain''t bad at all, I actually gave you a 6. It is a very good shot, nicely composed. As the DOF is very shallow , your point of focus needs to be crisper , but this is difficult to achieve given you choice of subject and color tones.', '2008-10-08 07:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998603, 721451, 67152, '<td valign="top">Delightfully quirky - just like the cars....</td>', 'Delightfully quirky - just like the cars....', '2008-10-08 07:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998605, 726498, 67152, '<td valign="top">A stunning glance, a simple composition, a wonderful perspective, the processing being understated allows her face to glow - fabulous work.  Congrats to the model for the ease she appears to have in front of the camera.<br/></td>', 'A stunning glance, a simple composition, a wonderful perspective, the processing being understated allows her face to glow - fabulous work.  Congrats to the model for the ease she appears to have in front of the camera.', '2008-10-08 08:01:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998609, 725976, 63398, '<td valign="top">Way to go......this is soooooooo unique and surreal. The PH ribbon was a no-brainer!</td>', 'Way to go......this is soooooooo unique and surreal. The PH ribbon was a no-brainer!', '2008-10-08 08:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998617, 725790, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  Main detractor for me was the cranes(?) directly behind the boarder.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  Main detractor for me was the cranes(?) directly behind the boarder.', '2008-10-08 08:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998619, 725118, 57886, '<td valign="top">I agree with the shadow part in the foreground, its a bit strange and distracting. But I do like the colors and the old house (would have loved to see all of it though... :o) But the score is ok!!</td>', 'I agree with the shadow part in the foreground, its a bit strange and distracting. But I do like the colors and the old house (would have loved to see all of it though... :o) But the score is ok!!', '2008-10-08 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998621, 723058, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5 and remember studying this for a while, mainly noticing that you seem to have set the lighting up well, that and the fact that this girl looked so sad.  Quite a nice image of her, with the moon behind and the good composition...</td>', 'I gave this a 5 and remember studying this for a while, mainly noticing that you seem to have set the lighting up well, that and the fact that this girl looked so sad.  Quite a nice image of her, with the moon behind and the good composition...', '2008-10-08 08:13:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998622, 725851, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5 - liked the composition and colors, but wished for sharper focus/deeper DOF mainly.</td>', 'I gave this a 5 - liked the composition and colors, but wished for sharper focus/deeper DOF mainly.', '2008-10-08 08:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998625, 724334, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4.  Thought that the composition/crop/framing needed work.  That, and the ''angle'', perhaps wasn''t the most .. flattering, for this fellow.</td>', 'I gave this a 4.  Thought that the composition/crop/framing needed work.  That, and the ''angle'', perhaps wasn''t the most .. flattering, for this fellow.', '2008-10-08 08:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998626, 718118, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4.  Liked the colors and the detail in the center, but the OOF fore dominated too much mainly.</td>', 'I gave this a 4.  Liked the colors and the detail in the center, but the OOF fore dominated too much mainly.', '2008-10-08 08:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998627, 726353, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3 - was a little ''snapshottish'' for me - perhaps a more dramatic angle and/or variation in post processing to give it an edge.. next time.</td>', 'I gave this a 3 - was a little ''snapshottish'' for me - perhaps a more dramatic angle and/or variation in post processing to give it an edge.. next time.', '2008-10-08 08:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998630, 726887, 28029, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot- I scored it a 10 but wished the scale went higher. Work like this adds a whole new dimension to DPC.</td>', 'Fantastic shot- I scored it a 10 but wished the scale went higher. Work like this adds a whole new dimension to DPC.', '2008-10-08 08:19:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998633, 725855, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 3 or 4.  Like the potential, but think more refined lighting and post processing will help get you where at appears you were trying to go.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 3 or 4.  Like the potential, but think more refined lighting and post processing will help get you where at appears you were trying to go.', '2008-10-08 08:24:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998634, 727132, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5.  Like the concept, wish it were bigger with this crop, and the top maybe more refined crop - else a little more context, perhaps.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5.  Like the concept, wish it were bigger with this crop, and the top maybe more refined crop - else a little more context, perhaps.', '2008-10-08 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998635, 727010, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 4.  The angle is distracting and seems to highlight the lock, which may have been your intent, but in my opinion is not the most interesting feature of the door.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 4.  The angle is distracting and seems to highlight the lock, which may have been your intent, but in my opinion is not the most interesting feature of the door.', '2008-10-08 08:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998638, 726428, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5.  Like the concept, even with keeping the two branches, cropping this tighter at the bottom gives it extra.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5.  Like the concept, even with keeping the two branches, cropping this tighter at the bottom gives it extra.', '2008-10-08 08:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998641, 725620, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 3.. Looks ''snapshottish'' to me - if you wanted to submit this particular image, perhaps going for a b&amp;w or toning effect may have given it extra.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 3.. Looks ''snapshottish'' to me - if you wanted to submit this particular image, perhaps going for a b&w or toning effect may have given it extra.', '2008-10-08 08:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998643, 726648, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 4.  Like the concept, variation in composition (bringing the potential swimmer further into the frame), bigger and maybe a little more context, make this better in my opinion.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 4.  Like the concept, variation in composition (bringing the potential swimmer further into the frame), bigger and maybe a little more context, make this better in my opinion.', '2008-10-08 08:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998644, 719270, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 3 or 4.  The frame is too heavy for the image and dominates.  The stop motion is quite good.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 3 or 4.  The frame is too heavy for the image and dominates.  The stop motion is quite good.', '2008-10-08 08:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998646, 722048, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious, Michelle!   Congrats on a great FS score.</td>', 'This is hilarious, Michelle!   Congrats on a great FS score.', '2008-10-08 08:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998647, 723739, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 6, maybe 7.  Nice portrait, looks like natural morning/evening light too.  A more refined crop, mainly left and bottom, give this a little extra in my opinion.  Nice relaxed and natural expression/pose.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 6, maybe 7.  Nice portrait, looks like natural morning/evening light too.  A more refined crop, mainly left and bottom, give this a little extra in my opinion.  Nice relaxed and natural expression/pose.', '2008-10-08 08:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998648, 727175, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5 - like the lighting and pose - more attention paid to the skin folds and clothing position, makes this better in my opinion.  She also looks like she needs to be a little more ''at ease''...</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5 - like the lighting and pose - more attention paid to the skin folds and clothing position, makes this better in my opinion.  She also looks like she needs to be a little more ''at ease''...', '2008-10-08 08:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998650, 725833, 7889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments. I had the camera pointing up and just kept firing. Only did a little usm. Could not do anything about the crop - that''s was how it came out. A bit of a panic entry because I have not been taking photos much lately.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for your comments. I had the camera pointing up and just kept firing. Only did a little usm. Could not do anything about the crop - that''s was how it came out. A bit of a panic entry because I have not been taking photos much lately. ', '2008-10-08 08:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998654, 725971, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5, maybe 6.  Really like that green, like to have seen it emphasized ''somehow'' - also wonder about a variation in cropping.  Just looks like there is more potential to this scene - whether by post processing or angle/technicals in the actual shoot.. not sure.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5, maybe 6.  Really like that green, like to have seen it emphasized ''somehow'' - also wonder about a variation in cropping.  Just looks like there is more potential to this scene - whether by post processing or angle/technicals in the actual shoot.. not sure.', '2008-10-08 08:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998656, 724295, 39850, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5 maybe 6.  Like the whites and the detail captured - the darker upper left area detracts from that and the image as a whole in my opinion, so perhaps a variation in crop may have given this an edge.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, maybe a 5 maybe 6.  Like the whites and the detail captured - the darker upper left area detracts from that and the image as a whole in my opinion, so perhaps a variation in crop may have given this an edge.', '2008-10-08 08:39:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998712, 721302, 36606, '<td valign="top">stunning shot. Spotted this immediately. Great process.</td>', 'stunning shot. Spotted this immediately. Great process.', '2008-10-08 08:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998738, 726944, 50695, '<td valign="top">forgot to comment but I gave this an 8. excellent shot.</td>', 'forgot to comment but I gave this an 8. excellent shot.', '2008-10-08 08:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998752, 726713, 50695, '<td valign="top">great color and pop to this. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'great color and pop to this. I gave it a 7.', '2008-10-08 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998766, 717458, 50695, '<td valign="top">less dpc friendly and more beautiful than you realize.</td>', 'less dpc friendly and more beautiful than you realize.', '2008-10-08 08:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998783, 725204, 50695, '<td valign="top">well um I did give this a 7 I just never commented or bumped it. sometimes with the anonymity I make the mistake of not trusting the photographer enough.</td>', 'well um I did give this a 7 I just never commented or bumped it. sometimes with the anonymity I make the mistake of not trusting the photographer enough.', '2008-10-08 09:00:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4998792, 726816, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot Deb! I gave it an 8 in voting. I think you did well with the dodging and burning. If you download the filter Bad Dream from Xero it will do an exaggerated dodge &amp; burn that you can either fade or just use as a guide (see what it does, undo do it and do just the bits you want).</td>', 'This is a great shot Deb! I gave it an 8 in voting. I think you did well with the dodging and burning. If you download the filter Bad Dream from Xero it will do an exaggerated dodge & burn that you can either fade or just use as a guide (see what it does, undo do it and do just the bits you want).', '2008-10-08 09:01:48.000000', NULL, 0),
