(4999008, 720993, 66193, '<td valign="top">james, I really like how you''ve composed this one.  You put the bird''s face nearer the edges and not in the center.  Ask your dad about the rule of thirds, and he''ll tell you how well you used it here!  I also like your choice of f-stop and how it blurs the background.  Well done!  I look forward to seeing more of your pictures here.</td>', 'james, I really like how you''ve composed this one.  You put the bird''s face nearer the edges and not in the center.  Ask your dad about the rule of thirds, and he''ll tell you how well you used it here!  I also like your choice of f-stop and how it blurs the background.  Well done!  I look forward to seeing more of your pictures here.', '2008-10-08 10:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
