(5003318, 721352, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and those big eyes, even if the nose is in sharper focus.  I have a Gracie, too, and she is a MENACE!  And possibly the happiest dog I know :-)  Yours is a darling; hope she has a long and happy life with you.</td>', 'Love the angle and those big eyes, even if the nose is in sharper focus.  I have a Gracie, too, and she is a MENACE!  And possibly the happiest dog I know :-)  Yours is a darling; hope she has a long and happy life with you.', '2008-10-10 19:36:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5003326, 725234, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective!  I like it more the longer I look at it, with the great patterns in the roots up on the surface and the beginnings of the annual leaf fall.  The angle makes it look like the tree is holding on for dear life.</td>', 'Awesome perspective!  I like it more the longer I look at it, with the great patterns in the roots up on the surface and the beginnings of the annual leaf fall.  The angle makes it look like the tree is holding on for dear life.', '2008-10-10 19:42:33.000000', NULL, 0),
