(5004275, 725976, 30861, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful image. Hippos running underwater have always fascinated me. Did you see the Cousteau movie about them? It took them likke 20 years to make the film...</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful image. Hippos running underwater have always fascinated me. Did you see the Cousteau movie about them? It took them likke 20 years to make the film...', '2008-10-11 18:40:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5004390, 724248, 24454, '<td valign="top">With this one, my thoughts are that I''m afraid our voting community still has a bit of the "doesn''t get it" disorder as far as being artsy and creative.  To me, it very much looks like a high-6, dpc-friendly style as far as subject, composition and processing, but the artistic (and very cool in my opinion) use of blur probably is a little ahead of most of the voters in the artsy department. Plus, the free study factor doesn''t help much either.<br/> <br/>Again, tho, I think it is AWESOME, and one I would have voted really high.<br/> <br/></td>', 'With this one, my thoughts are that I''m afraid our voting community still has a bit of the "doesn''t get it" disorder as far as being artsy and creative.  To me, it very much looks like a high-6, dpc-friendly style as far as subject, composition and processing, but the artistic (and very cool in my opinion) use of blur probably is a little ahead of most of the voters in the artsy department. Plus, the free study factor doesn''t help much either. Again, tho, I think it is AWESOME, and one I would have voted really high. ', '2008-10-11 21:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
