(5005159, 726554, 16230, '<td valign="top">After comparing this photo to your Color Studio Portrait III entry "Wild Child", I think I give the nod to Wild Child. I love the colors of the scarf in this one, but I prefer the more natural look of her hair in the other photo. It''s a tough choice though because they are both wonderful portraits. Congratulations!</td>', 'After comparing this photo to your Color Studio Portrait III entry "Wild Child", I think I give the nod to Wild Child. I love the colors of the scarf in this one, but I prefer the more natural look of her hair in the other photo. It''s a tough choice though because they are both wonderful portraits. Congratulations!', '2008-10-12 16:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
