(5005290, 726971, 45475, '<td valign="top">I would have expected this to finish much higher. This is by far a more difficult shot to obtain than those who finished above, and absolutely comes back to how well you work with your equipment and environment.<br/> <br/>Still, can''t scoff at a 6.4 when you''re up against so many pretty photos! Congrats!</td>', 'I would have expected this to finish much higher. This is by far a more difficult shot to obtain than those who finished above, and absolutely comes back to how well you work with your equipment and environment. Still, can''t scoff at a 6.4 when you''re up against so many pretty photos! Congrats!', '2008-10-12 18:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005613, 721302, 56744, '<td valign="top">Imagem brutal e perfeitamente executada numa técnica que usualmente produz resultados artificiais, o que não é o caso, pois aqui a harmonia das cores e a subtileza dos detalhes é superlativa. Parabéns!</td>', 'Imagem brutal e perfeitamente executada numa técnica que usualmente produz resultados artificiais, o que não é o caso, pois aqui a harmonia das cores e a subtileza dos detalhes é superlativa. Parabéns!', '2008-10-12 21:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
