(5008142, 725459, 30982, '<td valign="top">What Andre said.  Then I read it was a candid shot - could have fooled me!  (And in fact you did.)  The elegance and grace of this is lovely, and I can''t quite get over how perfect her hair his.  :-)  Seriously, though, your choices of focal point and composition were excellent here.</td>', 'What Andre said.  Then I read it was a candid shot - could have fooled me!  (And in fact you did.)  The elegance and grace of this is lovely, and I can''t quite get over how perfect her hair his.  :-)  Seriously, though, your choices of focal point and composition were excellent here.', '2008-10-14 15:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
