(5009772, 720901, 87808, '<td valign="top">When I went to NY this year, I went to ground zero and the firehouse just across the street from there,  I stood in the street with tears streaming down my face.  To me, knowing that there are people in this world that touch you to the point of tears, for just helping people that they didn''t know.  Everyday they do this. It is not a job or a career.  It, to them is dedication to life.  The ultimate sacrifice, theirs, for ordinary people like us. <br/> <br/>Thank you for this photograph.</td>', 'When I went to NY this year, I went to ground zero and the firehouse just across the street from there,  I stood in the street with tears streaming down my face.  To me, knowing that there are people in this world that touch you to the point of tears, for just helping people that they didn''t know.  Everyday they do this. It is not a job or a career.  It, to them is dedication to life.  The ultimate sacrifice, theirs, for ordinary people like us.  Thank you for this photograph.', '2008-10-15 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 0),
