(5019866, 726956, 30807, '<td valign="top">This is GOOOD! It looks like taken in flight, but could be on the hand, as it were - I have a feeling that if you could copy the trees in the background, and reverse and paste to the blank space on the left, that it would look more settled. <br/> <br/>Or, take away the trees to white background, and it could well be a flight shot. I am intrigued by what it is eating - looks like some form of weird crustacean, or dyed oat ears<br/> <br/>better placing will come your way, I have no doubt - a very nice shot</td>', 'This is GOOOD! It looks like taken in flight, but could be on the hand, as it were - I have a feeling that if you could copy the trees in the background, and reverse and paste to the blank space on the left, that it would look more settled.  Or, take away the trees to white background, and it could well be a flight shot. I am intrigued by what it is eating - looks like some form of weird crustacean, or dyed oat ears better placing will come your way, I have no doubt - a very nice shot', '2008-10-22 05:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
