(5146296, 722557, 32767, '<td valign="top">Love Banksy. I''ve been photographing a good deal of grafitti and saw Banksy''s rat in Soho but didn''t snap a shot. Williamsburg, Brooklyn has been a hotbed for all sort of styles these days and I''ve caught a few nice shots, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=408799" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">like this one</a> but want to go out a grab more before they disappear. <a href="//pawdrix.zenfolio.com/p1006248062/h28a7476d#h28a7476d" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This may be one of his</a> but I''m going to stay on the look out for more, as they make for a nice theme.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-22 13:21:45.</i></td>', 'Love Banksy. I''ve been photographing a good deal of grafitti and saw Banksy''s rat in Soho but didn''t snap a shot. Williamsburg, Brooklyn has been a hotbed for all sort of styles these days and I''ve caught a few nice shots, like this one but want to go out a grab more before they disappear. This may be one of his but I''m going to stay on the look out for more, as they make for a nice theme.', '2008-12-22 13:20:44.000000', '2008-12-22 13:21:45.000000', 0),
