(5290451, 723617, 97270, '<td valign="top">I know I have already awarded a trophy to this picture... but I would like to comment again that this is one of those pictures that inspire me to pick the camera up.<br/> <br/>What a picture, Jason, what a picture!<br/> <br/>ETA: I would love to find out the post processing, if any, that you did here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-05 04:14:08.</i></td>', 'I know I have already awarded a trophy to this picture... but I would like to comment again that this is one of those pictures that inspire me to pick the camera up. What a picture, Jason, what a picture! ETA: I would love to find out the post processing, if any, that you did here.', '2009-03-05 04:12:50.000000', '2009-03-05 04:14:08.000000', 0),
(5296926, 726732, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one is a much stronger shot (and scored accordingly) given the crispness, dynamic comp, outstanding light and color - really brought out the detail very well!  My nit about this one (which probably accounts for a good score) is the lack of substance/texture in the background, but that''s personal taste - many prefer featureless backgrounds and it does serve to show off the bird well.</td>', 'This one is a much stronger shot (and scored accordingly) given the crispness, dynamic comp, outstanding light and color - really brought out the detail very well!  My nit about this one (which probably accounts for a good score) is the lack of substance/texture in the background, but that''s personal taste - many prefer featureless backgrounds and it does serve to show off the bird well.', '2009-03-09 03:53:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5300026, 724248, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture and expertly directed.  Great idea on the front man remaining motionless and the background group moving their heads...  Really creates a powerful image.</td>', 'Very cool capture and expertly directed.  Great idea on the front man remaining motionless and the background group moving their heads...  Really creates a powerful image.', '2009-03-10 23:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5380270, 726882, 66515, '<td valign="top">With all of the eagle shots in your portfolio I''d say I like this one the most. I like the catch light in the eye as well as great detail you captured. The processing you''ve used is simple and effective and I like the shallow DOF</td>', 'With all of the eagle shots in your portfolio I''d say I like this one the most. I like the catch light in the eye as well as great detail you captured. The processing you''ve used is simple and effective and I like the shallow DOF', '2009-03-17 04:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5380892, 726732, 47906, '<td valign="top">Hey Jane, <br/> <br/>Sorry that I havent got here sooner. Beautiful picture taken at our GTG. I love the detail and the sharpness of the feathers on your hawk. That head tilt really does something for this shot. Congrats on a new PB. It was a blast hanging out with you and hopefully we can do something again.<br/> <br/>Rich</td>', 'Hey Jane,  Sorry that I havent got here sooner. Beautiful picture taken at our GTG. I love the detail and the sharpness of the feathers on your hawk. That head tilt really does something for this shot. Congrats on a new PB. It was a blast hanging out with you and hopefully we can do something again. Rich', '2009-03-17 08:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
