(5452564, 722048, 45243, '<td valign="top">This is so wonderful on so many levels !  Just delightful !<br/>Thanks for Sharing<br/>Walter<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-01 09:59:13.</i></td>', 'This is so wonderful on so many levels !  Just delightful !Thanks for SharingWalter', '2009-04-26 10:39:06.000000', '2009-05-01 10:59:13.000000', 0),
(5471896, 725087, 47487, '<td valign="top">I LOVE these birds. The Fresno zoo has them in an ordinary aviary walk-through cage covered with ivy, but the way the light is in the afternoon, it pours in through a gap near the roof and lights up their feathery heads and there''s this dark background and augh. Gorgeous. It''s like they did it just for photographers.<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful image and I can''t believe it didn''t score even better than it did.</td>', 'I LOVE these birds. The Fresno zoo has them in an ordinary aviary walk-through cage covered with ivy, but the way the light is in the afternoon, it pours in through a gap near the roof and lights up their feathery heads and there''s this dark background and augh. Gorgeous. It''s like they did it just for photographers. This is a wonderful image and I can''t believe it didn''t score even better than it did.', '2009-05-06 05:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5475793, 726015, 69008, '<td valign="top">For a guy that don''t care much about shooting flower shots, you''re pretty good at it.  Great score, and a very nice shot. Cloudy days are best for flower shooting, and real raindrops help as well.</td>', 'For a guy that don''t care much about shooting flower shots, you''re pretty good at it.  Great score, and a very nice shot. Cloudy days are best for flower shooting, and real raindrops help as well.', '2009-05-07 22:40:35.000000', NULL, 0),
